msgstr "D3: 参照基準"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D4: Flow & timing"
msgstr "D4: フローとタイミング"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Overall Judgment"
msgstr "全体の判定"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Variable containing the overall risk-of-bias judgment for each study."
msgstr "研究ごとのバイアスのリスクの全体的な判定が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "重み"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing study weights for weighted summary plots (e.g., inverse-"
"variance weights)."
msgstr ""
"重みつきの要約プロットに使う研究の重み(分散の逆数による重みなど)が入っている"
"変数です。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "プロット"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Summary plot"
msgstr "要約プロット"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display a bar chart showing the distribution of risk-of-bias judgments "
"across domains."
msgstr "ドメインごとのバイアスのリスクの判定の分布を示す棒グラフを表示します。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Weighted by study precision"
msgstr "研究の精度で重みづけ"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Weight the summary bars by study precision. Requires a weights variable."
msgstr "要約の棒を研究の精度で重みづけします。重みの変数が必要です。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Traffic light plot"
msgstr "信号機プロット"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display a matrix of colored circles showing per-study, per-domain risk-of-"
"bias judgments."
msgstr ""
"研究ごと・ドメインごとのバイアスのリスクの判定を、色付きの円の行列で表示しま"
"す。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Point size"
msgstr "点の大きさ"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Size of the traffic light circles."
msgstr "信号機の円の大きさです。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外観"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Color scheme"
msgstr "カラースキーム"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Select the color palette for risk-of-bias judgments."
msgstr "バイアスのリスクの判定に使うカラーパレットを選びます。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Cochrane"
msgstr "Cochrane"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Colourblind"
msgstr "色覚に配慮"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic I², the percentage of total variation across "
"studies due to heterogeneity in the model information section. Not available "
"for multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or heterogeneity meta-regression."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、研究間の全変動のうち異質性によるものの割合である"
"メタ分析のI²を含めます。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析や異質性のメタ回帰では利"
"用できません。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic H², an index indicating the ratio of total "
"variability to sampling variability in the model information section. Not "
"available for multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or heterogeneity meta-"
"regression."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、全体のばらつきと標本抽出によるばらつきの比を表す"
"指標であるメタ分析のH²を含めます。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析や異質性のメタ"
"回帰では利用できません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the generalized linear model type. Unconditional with fixed study "
"effects (UM.FS; default); unconditional with random study effects (UM.RS); "
"conditional with approximate likelihood (CM.AL; odds ratios only); "
"conditional with exact likelihood (CM.EL; odds ratios and incidence rate "
"ratios)."
msgstr ""
"一般化線形モデルの種類を選びます。研究の固定効果をもつ非条件付き(UM.FS、既"
"定)、研究の変量効果をもつ非条件付き(UM.RS)、近似尤度による条件付き(CM.AL、"
"オッズ比のみ)、厳密尤度による条件付き(CM.EL、オッズ比と発生率比)です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Allow the random study effects and random treatment effects to be correlated "
"in the unconditional model with random study effects."
msgstr ""
"研究の変量効果をもつ非条件付きモデルで、研究の変量効果と処置の変量効果が相関"
"することを許します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Options for assessing multicollinearity among predictors."
msgstr "予測子どうしの多重共線性を評価するオプションです。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Prefix exported column names"
msgstr "書き出す列名に接頭辞を付ける"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Add a prefix to every column exported by this analysis."
msgstr "この分析が書き出すすべての列に接頭辞を付けます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "接頭辞"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Prefix added to every exported column name."
msgstr "書き出すすべての列名に付ける接頭辞です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export observed-minus-fitted residuals on the effect-size scale."
msgstr "効果量のスケールでの、観測値から予測値を引いた残差を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Specify the correlation between the same construct type levels."
msgstr "同じ構成概念の種類の水準どうしの相関を指定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Profile likelihood diagnostics for free heterogeneity and selection "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"固定されていない異質性のパラメータと選択パラメータについて、プロファイル尤度"
"による診断を行います。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Profile free heterogeneity and selection parameters. Unavailable for ordinal "
"models."
msgstr ""
"固定されていない異質性のパラメータと選択パラメータのプロファイル尤度を求めま"
"す。順序制約を課したモデルでは利用できません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid ""
"Export all candidate models independently of the display filter. Column "
"names include the model and subgroup."
msgstr ""
"表示の絞り込みにかかわらず、すべての候補のモデルを書き出します。列名にはモデ"
"ルとサブグループが含まれます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid ""
"Selection models use maximum likelihood and z/Wald coefficient tests. The "
"same method and moderators apply to all candidates."
msgstr ""
"選択モデルでは、最尤法と係数のz検定(ワルド検定)を使います。すべての候補のモデ"
"ルに同じ方法とモデレータが適用されます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid ""
"Method used for model estimation in the meta-analysis. The available methods "
"depend on the inclusion of heterogeneity model terms."
msgstr ""
"メタ分析でモデルの推定に使う方法です。使える方法は、異質性のモデル項を含める"
"かどうかで変わります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Equal Effects"
msgstr "等効果"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Fixed Effects"
msgstr "固定効果"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Maximum Likelihood"
msgstr "最尤"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Restricted ML"
msgstr "制限付き最尤法"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "DerSimonian-Laird"
msgstr "DerSimonian-Laird法"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Hedges"
msgstr "ヘッジ(Hedges)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Hunter-Schmidt"
msgstr "Hunter-Schmidt"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Hunter-Schmidt (SSC)"
msgstr "Hunter-Schmidt (SSC)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Sidik-Jonkman"
msgstr "Sidik-Jonkman"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Empirical Bayes"
msgstr "経験ベイズ"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Paule-Mandel"
msgstr "Paule-Mandel"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Paule-Mandel (MU)"
msgstr "Paule-Mandel (MU)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Generalized Q-stat"
msgstr "一般化Q統計量"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Generalized Q-stat (MU)"
msgstr "一般化Q統計量 (MU)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Unrestricted Weighted Least Squares (UWLS)"
msgstr "制約なし重みつき最小二乗法(UWLS)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Optimizer"
msgstr "最適化"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Optimizer settings for fitting the selection models."
msgstr "選択モデルのあてはめに使う最適化の設定です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Optimizer settings for estimating the meta-analytic models. A more complex/"
"unavailbe settings can be specified via the 'Extend metafor call' option."
msgstr ""
"メタ分析モデルを推定する最適化の設定です。より複雑な設定やここにない設定は"
"「metaforの呼び出しを拡張」で指定できます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Select the optimizer used by metafor. The default is BFGS, including for "
"ordinal step functions."
msgstr ""
"metaforが使う最適化の方法を選びます。既定はBFGSで、順序制約を課したステップ関"
"数でも同じです。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Select the optimization method to use for fitting the model. Available in "
"multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or when heterogeneity model terms are "
"included."
msgstr ""
"モデルのあてはめに使う最適化の方法を選びます。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析の"
"場合、または異質性のモデル項を含めた場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Default"
msgstr "既定"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Initial 𝜏²"
msgstr "𝜏²の初期値"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Specify the initial value of 𝜏² for the optimization algorithm. Available "
"only for specific optimization methods and unavailable in multilevel/"
"multivariate meta-analysis or when heterogeneity model terms are included."
msgstr ""
"最適化アルゴリズムにおける𝜏²の初期値を指定します。特定の最適化の方法でのみ使"
"え、マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析や異質性のモデル項を含めた場合には利用できま"
"せん。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Minimum 𝜏²"
msgstr "𝜏²の最小値"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Specify the minimum allowable value of 𝜏² during optimization. Available "
"only for specific optimization methods and unavailable in multilevel/"
"multivariate meta-analysis or when heterogeneity model terms are included."
msgstr ""
"最適化の途中で𝜏²が取りうる最小値を指定します。特定の最適化の方法でのみ使え、"
"マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析や異質性のモデル項を含めた場合には利用できませ"
"ん。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Maximum 𝜏²"
msgstr "𝜏²の最大値"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Specify the maximum allowable value of 𝜏² during optimization. Available "
"only for specific optimization methods and unavailable in multilevel/"
"multivariate meta-analysis or when heterogeneity model terms are included."
msgstr ""
"最適化の途中で𝜏²が取りうる最大値を指定します。特定の最適化の方法でのみ使え、"
"マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析や異質性のモデル項を含めた場合には利用できませ"
"ん。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Maximum evaluations"
msgstr "関数評価の最大回数"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of function evaluations for the optimizer. Available "
"when using specific optimization methods in multilevel/multivariate meta-"
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"最適化における関数評価の最大回数を設定します。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析で"
"特定の最適化の方法を使う場合に利用できます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Maximum iterations"
msgstr "最大反復回数"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of iterations for the optimizer. Available when using "
"certain estimation or optimization methods."
msgstr ""
"最適化の最大反復回数を設定します。特定の推定法または最適化の方法を使う場合に"
"利用できます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Convergence tolerance"
msgstr "収束の許容誤差"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Set the convergence tolerance for the optimizer. Available when using "
"certain methods without heterogeneity model terms or specific optimizers in "
"multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."
msgstr ""
"最適化の収束の許容誤差を設定します。異質性のモデル項がない特定の方法を使う場"
"合、またはマルチレベル・多変量メタ分析で特定の最適化を使う場合に利用できま"
"す。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Convergence relative tolerance"
msgstr "収束の相対許容誤差"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Override the optimizer's relative convergence tolerance."
msgstr "最適化の相対的な収束の許容誤差を上書きします。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Set the relative convergence tolerance for the optimizer. Available when "
"heterogeneity model terms are included or using specific optimizers in "
"multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."
msgstr ""
"最適化の相対的な収束の許容誤差を設定します。異質性のモデル項を含めた場合、ま"
"たはマルチレベル・多変量メタ分析で特定の最適化を使う場合に利用できます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Step adjustment"
msgstr "ステップの調整"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Set the step adjustment factor for the optimizer. Available when using "
"certain methods without heterogeneity model terms and unavailable in "
"multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."
msgstr ""
"最適化のステップの調整係数を設定します。異質性のモデル項がない特定の方法を使"
"う場合に利用でき、マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析では使えません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Initial trust region radius"
msgstr "信頼領域の初期半径"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Set the initial trust region radius for the optimizer. Available when using "
"specific optimization methods in multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."
msgstr ""
"最適化における信頼領域の初期半径を設定します。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析で"
"特定の最適化の方法を使う場合に利用できます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Final trust region radius"
msgstr "信頼領域の最終半径"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Set the final trust region radius for the optimizer. Available when using "
"specific optimization methods in multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."
msgstr ""
"最適化における信頼領域の最終半径を設定します。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析で"
"特定の最適化の方法を使う場合に利用できます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid "Maximum restarts"
msgstr "再開の最大回数"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisOptimizer|"
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of restarts for the optimizer. Available when using "
"the Nelder-Mead method ('nmk') in multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."
msgstr ""
"最適化の再開の最大回数を設定します。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析でネルダー・"
"ミード法('nmk')を使う場合に利用できます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Weight Function"
msgstr "重み関数"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Include weight function estimates in the output."
msgstr "出力に重み関数の推定値を含めます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "P-value frequency table"
msgstr "p値の度数表"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Estimate counts within the specified p-value intervals."
msgstr "指定したp値の区間ごとに、推定値の個数を数えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Plot"
msgstr "プロット"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Visualize the relative probability of study being published across the range "
"of p-values."
msgstr "p値の範囲にわたって、研究が出版される相対的な確率を可視化します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Rescale x-axis"
msgstr "x軸を再スケール"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Space p-value thresholds equally along the x-axis."
msgstr "p値の閾値をx軸上に等間隔に配置します。"

