msgid "Power"
msgstr "べき"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Negative exponential power"
msgstr "負の指数べき"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Truncation"
msgstr "切断"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Estimated truncation (experimental)"
msgstr "切断(推定・試験的)"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid ""
"Choose a documented metafor selection function. Changing the function resets "
"the cutoff and selection-parameter fields to the new function's defaults."
msgstr ""
"metaforに用意されている選択関数を選びます。関数を変えると、カットオフと選択パ"
"ラメータの欄は新しい関数の既定値に戻ります。"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "選択"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "One-sided"
msgstr "片側"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Two-sided"
msgstr "両側"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid ""
"Use one-sided study p-values in the expected direction, or two-sided study p-"
"values for significance in either direction. This determines publication "
"selection; coefficient tests remain two-sided."
msgstr ""
"研究のp値として、予想される向きの片側p値か、どちらの向きの有意性も対象とする"
"両側p値を使います。これは出版における選択を決めるもので、係数の検定は両側のま"
"まです。"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Effect-size cutoff"
msgstr "効果量のカットオフ"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "P-value cutoffs"
msgstr "P値のカットオフ"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid ""
"Step functions: increasing cutoffs; 1 is appended automatically. Beta: "
"optional lower and upper truncation thresholds. Other p-value functions: "
"optional single threshold."
msgstr ""
"ステップ関数: 増加していくカットオフを指定します。1は自動で末尾に追加されま"
"す。ベータ: 切断の下限と上限の閾値を任意で指定します。その他のp値の関数: 閾値"
"を1つ任意で指定します。"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Selection parameters"
msgstr "選択パラメータ"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid ""
"Leave empty to estimate parameters, or enter one number/NA per parameter. "
"For step functions, enter 1 for the first, fixed reference weight. Beta and "
"negative exponential power have two parameters; estimated truncation uses "
"weight and cutoff."
msgstr ""
"空欄にするとパラメータを推定します。値を指定する場合は、パラメータごとに数値"
"かNAを1つずつ入力します。ステップ関数では、最初の固定された基準の重みとして1"
"を入力します。ベータと負の指数べきはパラメータが2つです。切断の推定では重みと"
"カットオフを使います。"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Precision dependence"
msgstr "精度への依存"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Standard error"
msgstr "標準誤差"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Variance"
msgstr "分散"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Inverse sample size"
msgstr "サンプルサイズの逆数"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Inverse square root sample size"
msgstr "サンプルサイズの平方根の逆数"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid ""
"Allow publication probability to depend on study precision as well as p-"
"values."
msgstr "出版される確率が、p値だけでなく研究の精度にも依存することを許します。"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Sample size"
msgstr "サンプルサイズ"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Select the sample-size variable used by this model's precision measure."
msgstr "このモデルの精度の指標に使うサンプルサイズの変数を選びます。"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Rescale precision"
msgstr "精度を再スケール"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid ""
"Divide the precision measure by its maximum, as in metafor's default. This "
"changes the scale of selection parameters. Turn off to reproduce "
"specifications using unscaled precision, including Preston et al. (2004)."
msgstr ""
"metaforの既定と同じく、精度の指標をその最大値で割ります。これにより選択パラ"
"メータのスケールが変わります。Preston et al. (2004) など、再スケールしていな"
"い精度を使う指定を再現するには、オフにしてください。"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid "Force ordinality"
msgstr "順序制約を課す"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunction|"
msgid ""
"Constrain weights to decrease with increasing p-values. Applies only to this "
"model."
msgstr ""
"p値が大きくなるにつれて重みが小さくなるよう制約します。このモデルにのみ適用さ"
"れます。"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunctions|"
msgid "Weight Function (Custom)"
msgstr "重み関数(カスタム)"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunctions|"
msgid ""
"Each element is a separate candidate model. Cutoffs use the selected p-value "
"sidedness; truncation cutoffs use the effect-size scale. None adds the "
"unadjusted model to the comparison."
msgstr ""
"各要素が別々の候補のモデルになります。カットオフは選んだp値の片側・両側に従"
"い、切断のカットオフは効果量のスケールを使います。「なし」は、補正なしのモデ"
"ルを比較に加えます。"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunctions|"
msgid "Show models"
msgstr "表示するモデル"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunctions|"
msgid "All"
msgstr "すべて"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunctions|"
msgid "Best BIC"
msgstr "BICが最良"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunctions|"
msgid "Best AIC"
msgstr "AICが最良"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunctions|"
msgid "Model %1"
msgstr "モデル %1"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunctions|"
msgid ""
"Filter detailed output when comparing multiple custom models. Comparisons "
"and exports always include all candidates. Ties are resolved by model order."
msgstr ""
"複数のカスタムモデルを比較するときに、詳細な出力を絞り込みます。比較と書き出"
"しには常にすべての候補が含まれます。同順位の場合はモデルの順番で決まります。"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunctions|"
msgid "Model comparison"
msgstr "モデル比較"

msgctxt "SelectionModelsWeightfunctions|"
msgid ""
"Compare all custom models using fit statistics and AIC, AICc, and BIC "
"weights, separately by subgroup."
msgstr ""
"適合統計量と、AIC・AICc・BICの重みを使って、すべてのカスタムモデルをサブグ"
"ループごとに比較します。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid ""
"Fit publication-bias selection models with metafor, including moderators and "
"comparisons between weight functions. All candidate models use the same "
"observations within each subgroup."
msgstr ""
"metaforを使って、出版バイアスの選択モデルをあてはめます。モデレータや重み関数"
"どうしの比較も含められます。各サブグループの中では、すべての候補のモデルが同"
"じ観測値を使います。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Observed effect sizes, on the scale used to fit the model."
msgstr "モデルのあてはめに使うスケールでの、観測された効果量です。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Standard errors corresponding to the effect sizes."
msgstr "効果量に対応する標準誤差です。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Predictors"
msgstr "予測変数"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid ""
"Continuous and categorical moderators. Specify interactions and the "
"intercept in Model."
msgstr ""
"連続とカテゴリカルのモデレータです。交互作用と切片は「モデル」で指定します。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Study Labels"
msgstr "研究ラベル"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid ""
"Labels for studies in plots. Missing labels do not exclude observations from "
"fitting."
msgstr ""
"プロットに表示する研究のラベルです。ラベルが欠測していても、その観測値はあて"
"はめから除外されません。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "サブグループ"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid ""
"Fit each candidate separately within each subgroup. Best AIC/BIC is "
"determined separately for each subgroup."
msgstr ""
"サブグループごとに、各候補を別々にあてはめます。AIC・BICが最良のモデルもサブ"
"グループごとに決まります。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "P-Value"
msgstr "p値"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid ""
"Optional selection p-values, greater than 0 and at most 1. Use p-values "
"matching the sidedness of each selection function. If unassigned, p-values "
"are calculated from effect sizes and standard errors."
msgstr ""
"選択に使うp値で、0より大きく1以下の値です(任意)。各選択関数の片側・両側に合っ"
"たp値を使ってください。割り当てない場合、p値は効果量と標準誤差から計算されま"
"す。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "No Selection"
msgstr "選択なし"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid ""
"Optional factor identifying estimates unaffected by selection. Choose the "
"unaffected level below; selection applies to all other levels. Both remain "
"in the analysis."
msgstr ""
"選択の影響を受けない推定値を識別する要因です(任意)。影響を受けない水準を下で"
"選ぶと、それ以外のすべての水準に選択が適用されます。どちらも分析には残りま"
"す。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Unaffected Level"
msgstr "影響を受けない水準"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid ""
"Estimates at this level are unaffected by selection. Selection applies to "
"all other levels of the assigned factor."
msgstr ""
"この水準の推定値は選択の影響を受けません。割り当てた要因のそれ以外のすべての"
"水準に選択が適用されます。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Publication bias adjustment"
msgstr "出版バイアスの補正"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "カスタム"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid ""
"4PSM uses one-sided p-value cutoffs .025 and .50; 3PSM uses .025. Custom "
"permits multiple weight functions."
msgstr ""
"4PSMは片側p値のカットオフ .025 と .50 を、3PSMは .025 を使います。「カスタ"
"ム」では複数の重み関数を指定できます。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Expected direction of the effect"
msgstr "予想される効果の向き"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Detect"
msgstr "自動判定"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid ""
"Detect uses the median effect in the fitted dataset, separately per "
"subgroup; a zero median selects positive. Two-sided functions ignore "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"「自動判定」は、あてはめに使うデータセットにおける効果の中央値を、サブグルー"
"プごとに使います。中央値が0のときは正になります。両側の関数では向きを考慮しま"
"せん。"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid "Force ordinality"
msgstr "順序制約を課す"

msgctxt "SelectionModels|"
msgid ""
"Require non-increasing step-function weights. Under Custom, specify this for "
"each model separately. Metafor's ordinal implementation is experimental; "
"some intervals and tests are unavailable."
msgstr ""
"ステップ関数の重みが増加しないよう制約します。「カスタム」では、モデルごとに"
"個別に指定してください。metaforの順序制約の実装は試験的なもので、一部の区間と"
"検定は利用できません。"

msgctxt "Upgrades|"
msgid ""
"Selection Models was reworked in Meta-Analysis module 0.98.0. Refreshing "
"this analysis replaces the saved results and may reset incompatible "
"settings. To rerun the original analysis, use JASP 0.98.1 with Meta-Analysis "
"module 0.95.5."
msgstr ""
"選択モデルの分析は、メタ分析モジュール 0.98.0 で作り直されました。この分析を"
"更新すると、保存されている結果が置き換えられ、互換でない設定が初期化されるこ"
"とがあります。元の分析を再実行するには、JASP 0.98.1 とメタ分析モジュール "
"0.95.5 を使ってください。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Method for testing the model coefficients: 'z' uses standard normal "
"approximation, 't' uses t-distribution, and 'knha' uses the Knapp and "
"Hartung adjustment (default). Clustered models use t-distribution based "
"tests."
msgstr ""
"モデルの係数を検定する方法です。'z'は標準正規近似、't'はt分布、'knha'はKnapp-"
"Hartungの調整(既定)を使います。クラスタのあるモデルではt分布による検定を使い"
"ます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultilevelMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Method for testing the model coefficients: 'z' uses standard normal "
"approximation, 't' uses t-distribution. Clustered models use t-distribution "
"based tests."
msgstr ""
"モデルの係数を検定する方法です。'z'は標準正規近似、't'はt分布を使います。クラ"
"スタのあるモデルではt分布による検定を使います。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid ""
"Adjust for publication bias with PET-PEESE meta-regressions fitted with "
"metafor. PET includes the standard errors and PEESE the sampling variances "
"as an additional moderator; the adjusted estimates correspond to a study "
"with a standard error of zero. Moderators, subgroups, clustering, and the "
"optional multilevel/multivariate model use the same specification as the "
"classical meta-analyses."
msgstr ""
"metaforであてはめたPET-PEESEのメタ回帰によって、出版バイアスを補正します。PET"
"は標準誤差を、PEESEは標本分散を、追加のモデレータとして含めます。補正後の推定"
"値は、標準誤差が0の研究に対応します。モデレータ、サブグループ、クラスタリン"
"グ、任意で指定するマルチレベル・多変量モデルは、古典的なメタ分析と同じ指定を"
"使います。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "References"
msgstr "文献"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "R Packages"
msgstr "Rパッケージ"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "Observed effect sizes, on the scale used to fit the model."
msgstr "モデルのあてはめに使うスケールでの、観測された効果量です。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "Standard errors corresponding to the effect sizes."
msgstr "効果量に対応する標準誤差です。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "Fixed effects test"
msgstr "固定効果の検定"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid ""
"Method for testing the model coefficients: 'z' uses standard normal "
"approximation, 't' uses t-distribution, and 'knha' uses the Knapp and "
"Hartung adjustment (default). Unrestricted weighted least squares always "
"uses the 'knha' test; clustered models use t-distribution based tests. The "
"multilevel/multivariate model uses 'z' or 't' tests."
msgstr ""
"モデルの係数を検定する方法です。'z'は標準正規近似、't'はt分布、'knha'はKnapp-"
"Hartungの調整(既定)を使います。制約なし重みつき最小二乗法では常に'knha'の検定"
"を使い、クラスタのあるモデルではt分布による検定を使います。マルチレベル・多変"
"量モデルでは'z'か't'の検定を使います。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "Predictors"
msgstr "予測変数"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid ""
"Continuous and categorical moderators. Specify interactions and the "
"intercept in Model. The bias term (standard error or sampling variance) is "
"always included."
msgstr ""
"連続とカテゴリカルのモデレータです。交互作用と切片は「モデル」で指定します。"
"バイアス項(標準誤差または標本分散)は常に含まれます。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "Clustering"
msgstr "クラスタリング"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating clustering of effect sizes for robust variance "
"estimation. If the variable is specified, cluster-robust tests and "
"confidence intervals are provided, including the test used for the PET-PEESE "
"model selection. See the 'Advanced' section for additional clustering "
"options."
msgstr ""
"頑健な分散推定のために、効果量のクラスタを示す変数です。変数を指定すると、"
"PET-PEESEのモデル選択に使う検定も含め、クラスタに頑健な検定と信頼区間が求めら"
"れます。クラスタリングのほかのオプションは「詳細」のセクションを見てくださ"
"い。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "Study Labels"
msgstr "研究ラベル"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid ""
"Labels for studies in plots. Missing labels do not exclude observations from "
"fitting."
msgstr ""
"プロットに表示する研究のラベルです。ラベルが欠測していても、その観測値はあて"
"はめから除外されません。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "サブグループ"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid ""
"Fit the models separately within each subgroup. The PET-PEESE model "
"selection is performed separately for each subgroup."
msgstr ""
"サブグループごとに、モデルを別々にあてはめます。PET-PEESEのモデル選択もサブグ"
"ループごとに行われます。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "No Selection"
msgstr "選択なし"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid ""
"Optional factor identifying estimates unaffected by publication bias. Choose "
"the unaffected level below; the bias term is set to zero for estimates at "
"that level, so only the remaining estimates inform the small-study effect. "
"Both remain in the analysis."
msgstr ""
"出版バイアスの影響を受けない推定値を識別する要因です(任意)。影響を受けない水"
"準を下で選ぶと、その水準の推定値ではバイアス項が0に設定され、残りの推定値だけ"
"が小規模研究効果の推定に使われます。どちらも分析には残ります。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "Unaffected Level"
msgstr "影響を受けない水準"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid ""
"Estimates at this level are unaffected by publication bias. The bias "
"adjustment applies to all other levels of the assigned factor."
msgstr ""
"この水準の推定値は出版バイアスの影響を受けません。割り当てた要因のそれ以外の"
"すべての水準にバイアスの補正が適用されます。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "Publication bias adjustment"
msgstr "出版バイアスの補正"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid ""
"PET adjusts for the relationship between the effect sizes and their standard "
"errors, PEESE for the relationship with the sampling variances. PET-PEESE "
"reports PEESE if the PET adjusted effect is significant at the PET-PEESE "
"threshold (see 'Advanced'), and PET otherwise (Stanley & Doucouliagos, 2014)."
msgstr ""
"PETは効果量とその標準誤差との関係を、PEESEは標本分散との関係を補正します。"
"PET-PEESEは、PETで補正した効果がPET-PEESEの閾値(「詳細」を参照)で有意であれば"
"PEESEを、そうでなければPETを報告します(Stanley & Doucouliagos, 2014)。"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid "Multilevel/multivariate"
msgstr "マルチレベル・多変量"

msgctxt "PetPeese|"
msgid ""
"Fit the PET and PEESE meta-regressions as multilevel/multivariate models "
"(metafor's 'rma.mv' function). Specify the dependency between the effect "
"sizes in the 'Effect Size Variance-Covariance Matrix' and 'Random Effects / "
"Model Components' sections. The standard errors used as the bias term are "
"the square roots of the sampling variances."
msgstr ""
"PETとPEESEのメタ回帰を、マルチレベル・多変量モデル(metaforの 'rma.mv' 関数)と"
"してあてはめます。効果量のあいだの依存関係は、「効果量の分散共分散行列」と"
"「変量効果・モデルの成分」のセクションで指定します。バイアス項に使う標準誤差"
"は、標本分散の平方根です。"

msgctxt "BubblePlot|"
msgid ""
"Show the observed estimates as bubbles. Uncheck to show only the model-based "
"estimates."
msgstr ""
"観測された推定値をバブルとして表示します。チェックを外すと、モデルにもとづく"
"推定値だけを表示します。"

msgctxt "BubblePlot|"
msgid ""
"Include prediction intervals of the estimated effect sizes. Unavailable for "
"unrestricted weighted least squares."
msgstr ""
"推定された効果量の予測区間を含めます。制約なし重みつき最小二乗法では利用でき"
"ません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Perform weighted estimation using inverse-variance weights. Uncheck for "
"unweighted estimation. Unavailable for multilevel/multivariate models, which "
"are always weighted by the inverse of the variance-covariance matrix."
msgstr ""
"分散の逆数による重みを使って重みつき推定を行います。チェックを外すと重みなし"
"の推定になります。マルチレベル・多変量モデルでは利用できません。このモデルで"
"は常に分散共分散行列の逆行列で重みづけされます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "PET-PEESE threshold"
msgstr "PET-PEESEの閾値"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Significance level of the two-sided test of the PET adjusted effect. If the "
"test is significant, PEESE is reported; otherwise PET is reported (Stanley & "
"Doucouliagos, 2014). Available for the conditional PET-PEESE adjustment."
msgstr ""
"PETで補正した効果についての両側検定の有意水準です。検定が有意であればPEESE"
"を、そうでなければPETを報告します(Stanley & Doucouliagos, 2014)。条件つきの"
"PET-PEESEによる補正で使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Random Effects / Model Structure"
msgstr "変量効果・モデルの構造"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Use sparse matrices"
msgstr "疎行列を使う"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Use custom weights for the effect sizes instead of inverse-variance weights. "
"Unavailable for PET-PEESE and WAAP-WLS estimated with unrestricted weighted "
"least squares, which is defined by the inverse-variance weights."
msgstr ""
"分散の逆数による重みではなく、効果量にカスタムの重みを使います。制約なし重み"
"つき最小二乗法で推定するPET-PEESEとWAAP-WLSでは利用できません。この方法は分散"
"の逆数による重みで定義されているためです。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Include a profile likelihood plot for the heterogeneity parameter (τ²). "
"Unavailable for equal effects, fixed effects, and unrestricted weighted "
"least squares models."
msgstr ""
"異質性のパラメータ(τ²)についてプロファイル尤度のプロットを含めます。等効果、"
"固定効果、制約なし重みつき最小二乗法のモデルでは利用できません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid ""
"Export the publication bias adjusted predicted values (i.e., at a standard "
"error of zero) and interval bounds."
msgstr ""
"出版バイアスを補正した予測値(標準誤差が0のときの値)と区間の限界を書き出しま"
"す。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid ""
"Export predicted values and interval bounds of the reported model. When WAAP "
"is reported, only the retained estimates receive values."
msgstr ""
"報告するモデルの予測値と区間の限界を書き出します。WAAPを報告する場合は、残し"
"た推定値にだけ値が入ります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "WAAP-WLS"
msgstr "WAAP-WLS"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Estimated power"
msgstr "推定された検出力"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid ""
"Export the power of each estimate to detect the effect of the WLS model (two-"
"sided z-test, α = .05), i.e., the value compared with the power criterion. "
"Exported for all estimates, also when WLS is reported."
msgstr ""
"各推定値がWLSモデルの効果を検出する検出力(両側z検定、α = .05)を書き出します。"
"これは検出力の基準と比べる値です。WLSを報告する場合も含め、すべての推定値につ"
"いて書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Included in WAAP"
msgstr "WAAPに含まれる"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid ""
"Export an indicator of the estimates included in the WAAP model (the "
"adequately powered and the unaffected estimates). Exported for all "
"estimates, also when WLS is reported."
msgstr ""
"WAAPモデルに含まれる推定値(十分な検出力を持つ推定値と影響を受けない推定値)を"
"示す指標を書き出します。WLSを報告する場合も含め、すべての推定値について書き出"
"します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid ""
"Method used for estimating the PET and PEESE meta-regressions. Unrestricted "
"weighted least squares (default) corresponds to the original PET-PEESE "
"specification with multiplicative heterogeneity (Stanley & Doucouliagos, "
"2014); the remaining methods estimate additive heterogeneity. The multilevel/"
"multivariate model is estimated with (restricted) maximum likelihood."
msgstr ""
"PETとPEESEのメタ回帰の推定に使う方法です。制約なし重みつき最小二乗法(既定)"
"は、乗法異質性を仮定する元のPET-PEESEの指定に対応します(Stanley & "
"Doucouliagos, 2014)。それ以外の方法は加法異質性を推定します。マルチレベル・多"
"変量モデルは(制限付き)最尤法で推定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid ""
"Method used for estimating the WLS and WAAP meta-analyses. Unrestricted "
"weighted least squares (default) corresponds to the original WAAP-WLS "
"specification with multiplicative heterogeneity (Stanley & Doucouliagos, "
"2017); the remaining methods estimate additive heterogeneity. The multilevel/"
"multivariate model is estimated with (restricted) maximum likelihood."
msgstr ""
"WLSとWAAPのメタ分析の推定に使う方法です。制約なし重みつき最小二乗法(既定)は、"
"乗法異質性を仮定する元のWAAP-WLSの指定に対応します(Stanley & Doucouliagos, "
"2017)。それ以外の方法は加法異質性を推定します。マルチレベル・多変量モデルは"
"(制限付き)最尤法で推定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Random Effects / Model Components"
msgstr "変量効果・モデルの成分"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Options for specifying the random effects components for the meta-analysis "
"model, including the types of random effects and their associated variables. "
"Allows modeling of complex data structures such as multilevel, multivariate, "
"autoregressive, spatial, and other forms of dependency."
msgstr ""
"メタ分析モデルの変量効果の成分を指定するオプションです。変量効果の種類とそれ"
"に対応する変数を含みます。マルチレベル、多変量、自己回帰、空間など、複雑な"
"データ構造や依存の形をモデル化できます。"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Component %1"
msgstr "成分 %1"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Type of random effect to include in the model."
msgstr "モデルに含める変量効果の種類です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "単純"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Nested (multilevel)"
msgstr "入れ子(マルチレベル)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Random slopes"
msgstr "変量傾き"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Structured"
msgstr "構造化"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Autoregressive"
msgstr "自己回帰"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Spatial"
msgstr "空間"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Known correlation"
msgstr "既知の相関"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Structure"
msgstr "構造"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Structure of the random effect when the type is 'Structured', "
"'Autoregressive', or 'Spatial'. Available structures depend on the selected "
"type."
msgstr ""
"種類が「構造化」「自己回帰」「空間」の場合の変量効果の構造です。選べる構造は"
"種類によって変わります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Compound symmetry"
msgstr "複合対称"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Heteroscedastic compound symmetry"
msgstr "不等分散の複合対称"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Unstructured "
msgstr "無構造 "

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "単位行列"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Diagonal"
msgstr "対角"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "AR(1)"
msgstr "AR(1)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Heteroscedastic AR(1)"
msgstr "不等分散のAR(1)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Continuous-time AR"
msgstr "連続時間AR"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Exponential"
msgstr "指数"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Gaussian"
msgstr "ガウス"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Linear"
msgstr "線形"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Rational quadratic"
msgstr "有理二次"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Spherical"
msgstr "球面"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Specification"
msgstr "指定"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Random Slope Terms"
msgstr "変量傾きの項"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Variables to include as random slope terms in the model. Available when the "
"random effect type is 'Random slopes'."
msgstr ""
"モデルに変量傾きの項として含める変数です。変量効果の種類が「変量傾き」の場合"
"に使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Factor Levels"
msgstr "要因の水準"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating the factor levels ('Inner Term') for the structured "
"random effect. Available when the random effect type is 'Structured'."
msgstr ""
"構造化された変量効果の要因の水準(内側の項)を示す変数です。変量効果の種類が"
"「構造化」の場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Level 1"
msgstr "水準1"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Level 2"
msgstr "水準2"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Level 3"
msgstr "水準3"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Level 4"
msgstr "水準4"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Level 5"
msgstr "水準5"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Time"
msgstr "時間"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating time points for an autoregressive random effects "
"structure. Available when the random effect type is 'Autoregressive'."
msgstr ""
"自己回帰の変量効果構造における時点を示す変数です。変量効果の種類が「自己回"
"帰」の場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Spatial Coordinates"
msgstr "空間座標"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Variables representing spatial coordinates for a spatial random effects "
"structure. Available when the random effect type is 'Spatial' and the "
"distance metric is not 'Great-circle' or prespecified in a file."
msgstr ""
"空間的な変量効果構造の座標を表す変数です。変量効果の種類が「空間」で、距離の"
"指標が「大圏距離」でもファイル指定でもない場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Longitude"
msgstr "経度"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Variable representing longitude (in decimal degrees, with minus signs for "
"West) for a spatial random effects structure using the 'Great-circle' "
"distance metric. Available when the random effect type is 'Spatial' and the "
"distance metric is 'Great-circle'."
msgstr ""
"「大圏距離」を使う空間的な変量効果構造で、経度(十進度。西経は負)を表す変数で"
"す。変量効果の種類が「空間」で、距離の指標が「大圏距離」の場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Latitude"
msgstr "緯度"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Variable representing latitude (in decimal degrees, with minus signs for "
"South) for a spatial random effects structure using the 'Great-circle' "
"distance metric. Available when the random effect type is 'Spatial' and the "
"distance metric is 'Great-circle'."
msgstr ""
"「大圏距離」を使う空間的な変量効果構造で、緯度(十進度。南緯は負)を表す変数で"
"す。変量効果の種類が「空間」で、距離の指標が「大圏距離」の場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Location Identifier"
msgstr "地点の識別子"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Variable identifying locations when loading distances matrix from a file for "
"a spatial random effects structure. The location corresponds to the row and "
"column names of the distance matrix. The names cannot start with a number."
msgstr ""
"空間的な変量効果構造で距離行列をファイルから読み込むときに、地点を識別する変"
"数です。地点は距離行列の行名・列名に対応します。名前を数字で始めることはでき"
"ません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Grouping Factor"
msgstr "グループ化要因"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Grouping variable specifying which observations share the same random effect "
"('Outer Term'). Available for random effect types other than 'Nested "
"(Multilevel)'. The 'Grouping Factor' is not required for 'Spatial' Random "
"Effects."
msgstr ""
"どの観測が同じ変量効果を共有するか(外側の項)を指定するグループ化変数です。"
"「入れ子(マルチレベル)」以外の変量効果の種類で使えます。「空間」の変量効果で"
"は不要です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Distance metric"
msgstr "距離の指標"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"Distance metric used to calculate distances in a spatial random effects "
"structure. Available when the random effect type is 'Spatial'."
msgstr ""
"空間的な変量効果構造で距離を計算する指標です。変量効果の種類が「空間」の場合"
"に使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Euclidean"
msgstr "ユークリッド"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Manhattan"
msgstr "マンハッタン"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "最大値"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Great-circle"
msgstr "大圏距離"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Load from file"
msgstr "ファイルから読み込む"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Distance matrix file"
msgstr "距離行列のファイル"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"CSV file containing the distance matrix for the spatial random effects "
"structure. The first row and the first column of the file must contain names "
"that map the matrix entries to the 'Location Identifier' (the names cannot "
"start with a number). Available when the random effect type is 'Spatial' and "
"the distance metric is loaded from a file."
msgstr ""
"空間的な変量効果構造の距離行列が入ったCSVファイルです。ファイルの1行目と1列目"
"には、行列の要素を「地点の識別子」に対応づける名前が必要です(名前を数字で始め"
"ることはできません)。変量効果の種類が「空間」で、距離の指標をファイルから読み"
"込む場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid "Correlation matrix file"
msgstr "相関行列のファイル"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisRandomEffects|"
msgid ""
"CSV file containing the known correlation matrix for the random effects "
"structure. The first row and the first column of the file must contain names "
"that map the matrix entries to the 'Grouping Factor' (the names cannot start "
"with a number). Available when the random effect type is 'Known correlation'."
msgstr ""
"変量効果構造の既知の相関行列が入ったCSVファイルです。ファイルの1行目と1列目に"
"は、行列の要素を「グループ化要因」に対応づける名前が必要です(名前を数字で始め"
"ることはできません)。変量効果の種類が「既知の相関」の場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "γ"
msgstr "γ"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include γ, the multiplicative heterogeneity of the unrestricted weighted "
"least squares model, i.e., the factor by which the sampling variances are "
"multiplied."
msgstr ""
"制約なし重みつき最小二乗法のモデルの乗法異質性γ、すなわち標本分散にかける係数"
"を含めます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "√γ"
msgstr "√γ"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include √γ, the square root of the multiplicative heterogeneity of the "
"unrestricted weighted least squares model."
msgstr "制約なし重みつき最小二乗法のモデルの乗法異質性の平方根√γを含めます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include prediction intervals in the tabular output. Unavailable for "
"unrestricted weighted least squares."
msgstr ""
"表の出力に予測区間を含めます。制約なし重みつき最小二乗法では利用できません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "PET-PEESE"
msgstr "PET-PEESE"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include the estimate of the bias coefficient: the standard error (PET) or "
"the sampling variance (PEESE) coefficient of the reported model."
msgstr ""
"報告するモデルのバイアス係数、すなわち標準誤差(PET)または標本分散(PEESE)の係"
"数の推定値を含めます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Regression plot"
msgstr "回帰プロット"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Visualize the fitted relationship between the effect sizes and their "
"standard errors. The fitted line (PET) or curve (PEESE) at a standard error "
"of zero corresponds to the adjusted estimate."
msgstr ""
"効果量とその標準誤差とのあいだのあてはめた関係を可視化します。標準誤差が0のと"
"きのあてはめた直線(PET)または曲線(PEESE)の値が、補正後の推定値に対応します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Unadjusted fixed effect estimate"
msgstr "補正なしの固定効果の推定値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the fixed effect estimate without publication bias adjustment (same "
"moderators and subgroups) for comparison with the adjusted estimate in the "
"model information section."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、出版バイアスを補正しない固定効果の推定値(モデレー"
"タとサブグループは同じ)を含め、補正後の推定値と比べられるようにします。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Unadjusted fixed effect estimate test"
msgstr "補正なしの固定効果の推定値の検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the test of the unadjusted fixed effect estimate in the model "
"information section."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、補正なしの固定効果の推定値の検定を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Unadjusted random effects estimate"
msgstr "補正なしの変量効果の推定値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the random effects estimate (restricted maximum likelihood) without "
"publication bias adjustment (same moderators and subgroups) for comparison "
"with the adjusted estimate in the model information section."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、出版バイアスを補正しない変量効果の推定値(制限付き"
"最尤法。モデレータとサブグループは同じ)を含め、補正後の推定値と比べられるよう"
"にします。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Unadjusted random effects estimate test"
msgstr "補正なしの変量効果の推定値の検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the test of the unadjusted random effects estimate in the model "
"information section."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、補正なしの変量効果の推定値の検定を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid ""
"Include predicted effect sizes in the middle section of the study-level "
"information panel. Unavailable when the panel is aggregated."
msgstr ""
"研究ごとの情報のパネルの中央のセクションに、予測された効果量を含めます。パネ"
"ルを集約している場合は利用できません。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Adjust for publication bias with WAAP-WLS meta-analyses fitted with metafor. "
"WLS is the meta-analysis of all estimates; WAAP (weighted average of the "
"adequately powered) is the meta-analysis of the estimates whose power to "
"detect the WLS effect reaches the power criterion. WAAP is reported if "
"enough estimates are adequately powered, WLS otherwise (Stanley, "
"Doucouliagos, & Ioannidis, 2017). Moderators, subgroups, clustering, and the "
"optional multilevel/multivariate model use the same specification as the "
"classical meta-analyses. When WAAP is reported, the study-level output "
"(e.g., forest plot, diagnostics, and exported values) includes only the "
"retained estimates."
msgstr ""
"metaforであてはめたWAAP-WLSのメタ分析によって、出版バイアスを補正します。WLS"
"はすべての推定値のメタ分析で、WAAP(十分な検出力を持つ推定値の重みつき平均)"
"は、WLSの効果を検出する検出力が検出力の基準に達する推定値のメタ分析です。十分"
"な検出力を持つ推定値が足りていればWAAPを、そうでなければWLSを報告します"
"(Stanley, Doucouliagos, & Ioannidis, 2017)。モデレータ、サブグループ、クラス"
"タリング、任意で指定するマルチレベル・多変量モデルは、古典的なメタ分析と同じ"
"指定を使います。WAAPを報告する場合、研究ごとの出力(フォレストプロット、診断、"
"書き出す値など)には残した推定値だけが含まれます。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "References"
msgstr "文献"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "R Packages"
msgstr "Rパッケージ"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "Observed effect sizes, on the scale used to fit the model."
msgstr "モデルのあてはめに使うスケールでの、観測された効果量です。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Standard errors corresponding to the effect sizes. The power of each "
"estimate is computed from its standard error."
msgstr ""
"効果量に対応する標準誤差です。各推定値の検出力は、その標準誤差から計算されま"
"す。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "Fixed effects test"
msgstr "固定効果の検定"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Method for testing the model coefficients: 'z' uses standard normal "
"approximation, 't' uses t-distribution, and 'knha' uses the Knapp and "
"Hartung adjustment (default). Unrestricted weighted least squares always "
"uses the 'knha' test; clustered models use t-distribution based tests. The "
"multilevel/multivariate model uses 'z' or 't' tests."
msgstr ""
"モデルの係数を検定する方法です。'z'は標準正規近似、't'はt分布、'knha'はKnapp-"
"Hartungの調整(既定)を使います。制約なし重みつき最小二乗法では常に'knha'の検定"
"を使い、クラスタのあるモデルではt分布による検定を使います。マルチレベル・多変"
"量モデルでは'z'か't'の検定を使います。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "Predictors"
msgstr "予測変数"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Continuous and categorical moderators. Specify interactions and the "
"intercept in Model."
msgstr ""
"連続とカテゴリカルのモデレータです。交互作用と切片は「モデル」で指定します。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "Clustering"
msgstr "クラスタリング"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating clustering of effect sizes for robust variance "
"estimation. If the variable is specified, cluster-robust tests and "
"confidence intervals are provided. See the 'Advanced' section for additional "
"clustering options."
msgstr ""
"頑健な分散推定のために、効果量のクラスタを示す変数です。変数を指定すると、ク"
"ラスタに頑健な検定と信頼区間が求められます。クラスタリングのほかのオプション"
"は「詳細」のセクションを見てください。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "Study Labels"
msgstr "研究ラベル"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Labels for studies in plots. Missing labels do not exclude observations from "
"fitting."
msgstr ""
"プロットに表示する研究のラベルです。ラベルが欠測していても、その観測値はあて"
"はめから除外されません。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "サブグループ"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Fit the models separately within each subgroup. The power of the estimates "
"and the WAAP-WLS model selection are evaluated separately for each subgroup."
msgstr ""
"サブグループごとに、モデルを別々にあてはめます。推定値の検出力とWAAP-WLSのモ"
"デル選択も、サブグループごとに評価されます。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "No Selection"
msgstr "選択なし"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Optional factor identifying estimates unaffected by publication bias. Choose "
"the unaffected level below; estimates at that level are always retained in "
"the WAAP model, regardless of their power."
msgstr ""
"出版バイアスの影響を受けない推定値を識別する要因です(任意)。影響を受けない水"
"準を下で選ぶと、その水準の推定値は検出力にかかわらず常にWAAPモデルに残りま"
"す。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "Unaffected Level"
msgstr "影響を受けない水準"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Estimates at this level are unaffected by publication bias. The power "
"criterion applies to all other levels of the assigned factor."
msgstr ""
"この水準の推定値は出版バイアスの影響を受けません。割り当てた要因のそれ以外の"
"すべての水準に検出力の基準が適用されます。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "Power criterion"
msgstr "検出力の基準"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Power that an estimate needs to reach to be retained in the WAAP model "
"(default 80%, between 5% and 99%). The power is the probability that a two-"
"sided z-test (α = .05) with the standard error of the estimate detects the "
"effect of the WLS model. At 5%, all estimates are retained."
msgstr ""
"推定値がWAAPモデルに残るために達する必要がある検出力です(既定は80%、5%から99%"
"の間)。検出力は、推定値の標準誤差を使った両側z検定(α = .05)がWLSモデルの効果"
"を検出する確率です。5%にすると、すべての推定値が残ります。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "Power conditional on moderators"
msgstr "モデレータを条件とした検出力"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Evaluate the power of each estimate at its predicted effect from the WLS "
"meta-regression, i.e., conditional on its moderator values (default). If "
"unticked, the power of all estimates is evaluated at the pooled effect of "
"the WLS model (at the mean of the moderators). Available when the model "
"includes moderators."
msgstr ""
"各推定値の検出力を、WLSのメタ回帰から予測されるその推定値の効果、すなわちモデ"
"レータの値を条件として評価します(既定)。チェックを外すと、すべての推定値の検"
"出力をWLSモデルの統合効果(モデレータの平均における値)で評価します。モデルにモ"
"デレータを含む場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid "Multilevel/multivariate"
msgstr "マルチレベル・多変量"

msgctxt "WaapWls|"
msgid ""
"Fit the WLS and WAAP models as multilevel/multivariate models (metafor's "
"'rma.mv' function). Specify the dependency between the effect sizes in the "
"'Effect Size Variance-Covariance Matrix' and 'Random Effects / Model "
"Components' sections. The power of each estimate is computed from its "
"standard error."
msgstr ""
"WLSとWAAPのモデルを、マルチレベル・多変量モデル(metaforの 'rma.mv' 関数)とし"
"てあてはめます。効果量のあいだの依存関係は、「効果量の分散共分散行列」と「変"
"量効果・モデルの成分」のセクションで指定します。各推定値の検出力は、その標準"
"誤差から計算されます。"

msgctxt "Upgrades|"
msgid ""
"PET-PEESE was reworked in Meta-Analysis module 0.99.0. Refreshing this "
"analysis replaces the saved results and may reset incompatible settings "
"(e.g., correlations and sample sizes are no longer accepted as input; use "
"Effect Size Computation to compute effect sizes and standard errors). To "
"rerun the original analysis, use the Meta-Analysis module 0.98.0."
msgstr ""
"PET-PEESEは、メタ分析モジュール 0.99.0 で作り直されました。この分析を更新する"
"と、保存されている結果が置き換えられ、互換でない設定が初期化されることがあり"
"ます(たとえば、相関とサンプルサイズは入力として受け付けなくなりました。効果量"
"と標準誤差は「効果量の計算」で求めてください)。元の分析を再実行するには、メタ"
"分析モジュール 0.98.0 を使ってください。"

msgctxt "Upgrades|"
msgid ""
"WAAP-WLS was reworked in Meta-Analysis module 0.99.0. Refreshing this "
"analysis replaces the saved results and may reset incompatible settings "
"(e.g., correlations and sample sizes are no longer accepted as input; use "
"Effect Size Computation to compute effect sizes and standard errors). To "
"rerun the original analysis, use the Meta-Analysis module 0.98.0."
msgstr ""
"WAAP-WLSは、メタ分析モジュール 0.99.0 で作り直されました。この分析を更新する"
"と、保存されている結果が置き換えられ、互換でない設定が初期化されることがあり"
"ます(たとえば、相関とサンプルサイズは入力として受け付けなくなりました。効果量"
"と標準誤差は「効果量の計算」で求めてください)。元の分析を再実行するには、メタ"
"分析モジュール 0.98.0 を使ってください。"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Network Meta-Analysis (beta)"
msgstr "ネットワークメタ分析 (ベータ版)"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Classical Network Meta-Analysis (beta)"
msgstr "伝統的ネットワークメタ分析 (ベータ版)"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Classical network meta-analysis compares multiple treatments simultaneously "
"by combining direct and indirect evidence from studies comparing different "
"sets of treatments. It uses the frequentist graph-theoretical approach "
"implemented in the netmeta package and supports contrast-based data (one row "
"per treatment comparison) and arm-based data (one row per study arm) for "
"binary, continuous, and incidence rate outcomes and for arm-level effect "
"sizes with standard errors. The analysis provides common-effect and random-"
"effects network estimates, heterogeneity and inconsistency assessments, "
"treatment rankings, league tables, network and forest plots, small-study "
"effects assessment, network meta-regression, subgroup analysis, rare-event "
"pooling methods, component network meta-analysis, and the netmeta R code."
msgstr ""
"伝統的ネットワークメタ分析は、異なる組み合わせの処置を比較した研究から直接"
"エビデンスと間接エビデンスを統合して、複数の処置を同時に比較します。netmeta "
"パッケージに実装された頻度論的なグラフ理論的アプローチを使い、2値・連続・発生"
"率のアウトカムと、標準誤差つきの群ごとの効果量について、対比ベースのデータ(処"
"置の比較ごとに1行)と群ベースのデータ(研究の群ごとに1行)を扱えます。共通効果と"
"変量効果のネットワーク推定値、異質性と非一貫性の評価、処置の順位づけ、リーグ"
"表、ネットワーク図とフォレストプロット、小規模研究効果の評価、"
"ネットワークメタ回帰、サブグループ分析、まれなイベントのための統合方法、成分"
"ネットワークメタ分析、netmeta の R コードを出力します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "References"
msgstr "文献"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "R Packages"
msgstr "Rパッケージ"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Outcome"
msgstr "アウトカム"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Type of the arm-level outcome data."
msgstr "群ごとのアウトカムのデータの種類です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Binary"
msgstr "2値"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of events and sample size per arm."
msgstr "群ごとのイベント数とサンプルサイズです。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Continuous"
msgstr "連続"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Mean, standard deviation, and sample size per arm."
msgstr "群ごとの平均、標準偏差、サンプルサイズです。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Incidence rate"
msgstr "発生率"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of events and person-time at risk per arm."
msgstr "群ごとのイベント数と、リスクにさらされた人時です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect size and standard error"
msgstr "効果量と標準誤差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Effect size and its standard error per arm (e.g., the mean of the arm and "
"its standard error); the treatment effects are the differences of the arm "
"effect sizes."
msgstr ""
"群ごとの効果量とその標準誤差です(群の平均とその標準誤差など)。処置効果は群の"
"効果量の差になります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect size measure"
msgstr "効果量の指標"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Effect size measure of the treatment effects: supplied as the 'Effect Size' "
"(contrast-based data) or computed from the arm-level data (arm-based binary, "
"continuous, and incidence rate data). The measure labels the netmeta model; "
"the estimates of contrast-based data do not depend on it."
msgstr ""
"処置効果の効果量の指標です。「効果量」 として与えるか(対比ベースのデータ)、群"
"ごとのデータから計算します(群ベースの2値・連続・発生率のデータ)。指標は "
"netmeta のモデルのラベルになりますが、対比ベースのデータの推定値は指標に依存"
"しません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log odds ratio"
msgstr "対数オッズ比"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log risk ratio"
msgstr "対数リスク比"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Risk difference"
msgstr "リスク差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Arcsine square root difference"
msgstr "逆正弦平方根の差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Mean difference"
msgstr "平均差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Standardized mean difference"
msgstr "標準化平均差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Standardized mean difference (Cohen's d as computed by meta::pairwise(), "
"without a small-sample correction)"
msgstr "標準化平均差 (meta::pairwise() で計算したコーエンのd。小標本の補正なし)"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log ratio of means"
msgstr "平均比の対数"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log incidence rate ratio"
msgstr "対数発生率比"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Incidence rate difference"
msgstr "発生率差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Square root incidence rate difference"
msgstr "発生率の平方根の差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Mean difference on the original outcome scale"
msgstr "もとのアウトカムの尺度での平均差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Standardized mean difference such as Cohen's d or Hedges' g"
msgstr "コーエンのdやヘッジのgなどの標準化平均差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Fisher's z"
msgstr "フィッシャー(Fisher)のz"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Fisher's z transformation of correlation coefficients"
msgstr "相関係数のフィッシャーのz変換"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log hazard ratio"
msgstr "対数ハザード比"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "General"
msgstr "一般"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"General effect size that does not correspond to any of the measures above."
msgstr "上のどの指標にも当てはまらない一般の効果量です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Arm effect size measure"
msgstr "群の効果量の指標"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Measure of the 'Arm Effect Size'. The treatment effects are the differences "
"of the arm effect sizes, and the measure defines their effect size measure "
"(e.g., the differences of arm means are mean differences). The measure "
"labels the netmeta model; the estimates do not depend on it."
msgstr ""
"「群の効果量」 の指標です。処置効果は群の効果量の差で、この指標が処置効果の効"
"果量の指標を決めます(群の平均の差は平均差になる、など)。指標は netmeta の"
"モデルのラベルになりますが、推定値は指標に依存しません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Mean"
msgstr "平均"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Mean of the arm; the treatment effects are mean differences."
msgstr "群の平均です。処置効果は平均差になります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log mean"
msgstr "平均の対数"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log mean of the arm; the treatment effects are log ratios of means."
msgstr "群の平均の対数です。処置効果は平均比の対数になります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Proportion"
msgstr "割合"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Proportion of the arm; the treatment effects are risk differences."
msgstr "群の割合です。処置効果はリスク差になります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log proportion"
msgstr "割合の対数"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log proportion of the arm; the treatment effects are log risk ratios."
msgstr "群の割合の対数です。処置効果は対数リスク比になります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Logit proportion"
msgstr "割合のロジット"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Logit proportion (log odds) of the arm; the treatment effects are log odds "
"ratios."
msgstr "群の割合のロジット(対数オッズ)です。処置効果は対数オッズ比になります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Incidence rate of the arm; the treatment effects are incidence rate "
"differences."
msgstr "群の発生率です。処置効果は発生率差になります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log incidence rate"
msgstr "発生率の対数"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Log incidence rate of the arm; the treatment effects are log incidence rate "
"ratios."
msgstr "群の発生率の対数です。処置効果は対数発生率比になります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"General arm effect size that does not correspond to any of the measures "
"above."
msgstr "上のどの指標にも当てはまらない一般の群の効果量です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect Size"
msgstr "効果量"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing the observed treatment effect of 'Treatment 1' versus "
"'Treatment 2', on the scale used to fit the model (e.g., log odds ratios for "
"odds ratios)."
msgstr ""
"「処置1」 対 「処置2」 の観測された処置効果が入っている変数です。モデルを当て"
"はめるスケールで与えます(オッズ比なら対数オッズ比など)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect Size Standard Error"
msgstr "効果量標準誤差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing the standard errors corresponding to the effect sizes."
msgstr "効果量に対応する標準誤差が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Treatment 1"
msgstr "処置1"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing the first treatment of the comparison. The effect size "
"is the effect of this treatment versus 'Treatment 2'."
msgstr ""
"比較の1つめの処置が入っている変数です。効果量は、この処置の 「処置2」 に対す"
"る効果です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Treatment 2"
msgstr "処置2"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing the second treatment of the comparison (the comparator)."
msgstr "比較の2つめの処置(比較対照)が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Treatment"
msgstr "処置"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable containing the treatment received in the study arm."
msgstr "研究の群で受けた処置が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Events"
msgstr "イベント数"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable containing the number of events in the study arm."
msgstr "研究の群のイベント数が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable containing the mean outcome in the study arm."
msgstr "研究の群のアウトカムの平均が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "標準偏差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing the standard deviation of the outcome in the study arm."
msgstr "研究の群のアウトカムの標準偏差が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Sample Size"
msgstr "サンプルサイズ"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable containing the number of participants in the study arm."
msgstr "研究の群の参加者数が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Person-Time"
msgstr "人時"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable containing the person-time at risk in the study arm."
msgstr "研究の群の、リスクにさらされた人時が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Arm Effect Size"
msgstr "群の効果量"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing the effect size of the study arm, on the scale of the "
"'Arm effect size measure' (e.g., the mean or the log incidence rate of the "
"arm)."
msgstr ""
"研究の群の効果量が入っている変数です。「群の効果量の指標」 のスケールで与えま"
"す(群の平均や発生率の対数など)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Arm Effect Size Standard Error"
msgstr "群の効果量の標準誤差"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable containing the standard errors of the arm-level effect sizes."
msgstr "群ごとの効果量の標準誤差が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Study ID"
msgstr "研究ID"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable identifying the study. All rows (contrast-based data) or arms (arm-"
"based data) with the same value belong to the same study; studies with more "
"than two arms are handled as multi-arm studies."
msgstr ""
"研究を識別する変数です。同じ値をもつすべての行(対比ベースのデータ)または群(群"
"ベースのデータ)は同じ研究に属します。3群以上の研究は多群の研究として扱います"
"。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Pooling method"
msgstr "統合の方法"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Method used to pool the binary data. The inverse variance method pools the "
"log odds ratios. The Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and "
"penalized logistic regression methods (suitable for sparse data) work with "
"the event counts directly. Available for log odds ratios of arm-based binary "
"data. The Mantel-Haenszel and non-central hypergeometric methods provide "
"only common-effect (equal effects) results. Penalized logistic regression "
"models random effects by a dispersion factor instead of a between-study "
"variance. These methods require the arm-level event counts and provide no "
"heterogeneity statistics and prediction intervals. Penalized logistic "
"regression can take a while to fit (about 15 seconds per model)."
msgstr ""
"2値データを統合する方法です。分散の逆数による方法は対数オッズ比を統合します。"
"Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布法、罰則付きロジスティック回帰(疎なデータに"
"向く)は、イベント数を直接扱います。群ベースの2値データの対数オッズ比で使えま"
"す。Mantel-Haenszel 法と非心超幾何分布法は、共通効果(等効果)の結果だけを出し"
"ます。罰則付きロジスティック回帰は、研究間分散の代わりに過分散の係数で変量効"
"果をモデル化します。これらの方法には群ごとのイベント数が必要で、異質性の統計"
"量と予測区間は出ません。罰則付きロジスティック回帰は当てはめに時間がかかるこ"
"とがあります(1モデルあたり約15秒)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Inverse variance"
msgstr "分散の逆数"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Inverse variance method applied to the pairwise log odds ratios."
msgstr "対比較の対数オッズ比に、分散の逆数による方法を適用します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Mantel-Haenszel"
msgstr "Mantel-Haenszel 法"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Mantel-Haenszel method (common-effect only)."
msgstr "Mantel-Haenszel 法です(共通効果のみ)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Non-central hypergeometric"
msgstr "非心超幾何分布法"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Method based on the non-central hypergeometric distribution (common-effect "
"only)."
msgstr "非心超幾何分布にもとづく方法です(共通効果のみ)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Penalized logistic regression"
msgstr "罰則付きロジスティック回帰"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Penalized logistic regression (slow: about 15 seconds per model)."
msgstr "罰則付きロジスティック回帰です(遅い: 1モデルあたり約15秒)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Fixed effects test"
msgstr "固定効果の検定"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Method for testing the treatment effects and computing their confidence "
"intervals: 'z' uses the standard normal approximation, 't' uses the t-"
"distribution with the degrees of freedom of the overall Q statistic (for the "
"confidence intervals, the p-values, and the P-scores). The t-distribution is "
"available for the random-effects model of the standard model only."
msgstr ""
"処置効果の検定と信頼区間の計算の方法です。'z' は標準正規近似を、't' は全体の "
"Q 統計量の自由度をもつ t 分布を使います(信頼区間、p 値、P スコアに適用)。t 分"
"布は、標準モデルの変量効果モデルでのみ使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Component Indicators"
msgstr "成分の指示変数"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variables containing 0/1 indicators of the components that form each "
"treatment. The indicators must be constant within each treatment. An "
"interaction between components is an additional indicator variable that is 1 "
"for the treatments that contain all of its components. Available for arm-"
"based data when the component model defines the components by indicator "
"variables."
msgstr ""
"各処置を構成する成分の 0/1 の指示変数です。指示変数は各処置の中で一定でなけれ"
"ばなりません。成分間の交互作用は追加の指示変数で、そのすべての成分を含む処置"
"で1になります。成分モデルで成分を指示変数で定義する場合に、群ベースのデータで"
"使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Predictor"
msgstr "予測変数"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Study-level variable to include as a predictor (moderator) in the network "
"meta-regression. The predictor must be constant within each study and can be "
"continuous or have two levels. Continuous predictors are not centered; "
"centering (e.g., years since 2000) can help the meta-regression converge. "
"The moderation test is the Wald test of the slope coefficients of the "
"predictor; the residual heterogeneity test is the test of the heterogeneity "
"not explained by the treatment effects and the predictor. The network meta-"
"regression is available for the standard model only (the input is hidden for "
"the component model and the variable is returned to the available "
"variables), and not for the Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and "
"penalized logistic regression pooling methods."
msgstr ""
"ネットワークメタ回帰に予測変数(モデレータ)として含める研究レベルの変数です。"
"予測変数は各研究の中で一定でなければならず、連続の変数か2水準の変数にできます"
"。連続の予測変数は中心化しません。中心化(2000年からの年数など)すると、メタ回"
"帰が収束しやすくなることがあります。モデレーションの検定は予測変数の傾きの係"
"数のワルド検定で、残差異質性の検定は、処置効果と予測変数で説明されない異質性"
"の検定です。ネットワークメタ回帰は標準モデルでのみ使え(成分モデルでは入力欄が"
"隠れ、変数は利用可能な変数に戻ります)、Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布によ"
"る方法、罰則付きロジスティック回帰の統合方法では使えません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "サブグループ"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Study-level variable indicating subgroup stratification. For each subgroup, "
"an independent network meta-analysis is fitted to the corresponding data set "
"subset, and the network estimates of the subgroups are compared by a test "
"for subgroup differences: for each comparison estimated in at least two "
"subgroups, Cochran's Q test of the difference between the network estimates "
"of the subgroups, with inverse-variance weights. The subgroup must be "
"constant within each study."
msgstr ""
"サブグループへの層別を示す研究レベルの変数です。サブグループごとに、対応する"
"データの部分集合に独立したネットワークメタ分析を当てはめ、サブグループの"
"ネットワーク推定値をサブグループ間の差の検定で比べます。少なくとも2つの"
"サブグループで推定された比較のそれぞれについて、サブグループのネットワーク推"
"定値の差を、分散の逆数による重みを用いた Cochran の Q 検定で検定します。"
"サブグループは各研究の中で一定でなければなりません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Data format"
msgstr "データの形式"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify whether the data contain one row per treatment comparison (contrast-"
"based) or one row per study arm (arm-based)."
msgstr ""
"データが処置の比較ごとに1行(対比ベース)か、研究の群ごとに1行(群ベース)かを指"
"定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Contrast-based"
msgstr "対比ベース"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Each row contains a treatment effect (with its standard error) of 'Treatment "
"1' versus 'Treatment 2'. A multi-arm study must be specified by all of its "
"pairwise comparisons (three rows for a three-arm study, six rows for a four-"
"arm study)."
msgstr ""
"各行には 「処置1」 対 「処置2」 の処置効果(とその標準誤差)が入ります。多群の"
"研究は、そのすべての対比較で指定しなければなりません(3群の研究なら3行、4群の"
"研究なら6行)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Arm-based"
msgstr "群ベース"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Each row contains the data of one treatment arm of a study. The treatment "
"effects are computed from the arm-level data."
msgstr ""
"各行には、研究の1つの処置群のデータが入ります。処置効果は群ごとのデータから計"
"算します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Input summary"
msgstr "入力の要約"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a table summarizing the analysed network: the numbers of studies, "
"pairwise comparisons, treatments, designs, and multi-arm studies, and, for "
"arm-based data, the number of observations or the person-time."
msgstr ""
"分析したネットワークをまとめた表を含めます。研究数、対比較の数、処置数、"
"デザイン数、多群の研究の数と、群ベースのデータでは観測数または人時を示します"
"。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Reference treatment"
msgstr "基準の処置"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Select a reference treatment"
msgstr "基準の処置を選んでください"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a treatment to see comparisons against it, including treatment "
"effects, forest plots, and study impact. This choice also sets the reference "
"for network meta-regression and for ordering the forest plot by effect size "
"or the funnel plot and its tests by reference treatment. The network "
"summary, network plot, and all-pairwise comparisons are available before a "
"reference is selected. If the selected treatment is absent from an analysed "
"network (e.g., in a subgroup), the first treatment in that network is used. "
"A disconnected component model uses the inactive treatment if available."
msgstr ""
"処置を選ぶと、その処置との比較(処置効果、フォレストプロット、研究の影響など)"
"が表示されます。この選択は、ネットワークメタ回帰の基準と、フォレストプロット"
"を効果量で並べるときやファンネルプロットとその検定を基準の処置で並べるときの"
"基準にもなります。ネットワークの要約、ネットワーク図、すべての対比較は、基準"
"を選ぶ前から使えます。選んだ処置が分析したネットワーク(サブグループなど)にな"
"い場合は、そのネットワークの最初の処置を使います。連結していない成分モデルで"
"は、不活性の処置があればそれを使います。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Beneficial effect"
msgstr "有益な効果"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Direction of the treatment effects that indicates a benefit of the "
"treatment. It determines the treatment ranking (P-score, SUCRA, probability "
"of being best, mean and median rank, and rankogram) and the order by ranking "
"of the league table and the forest plot. For ratio measures (e.g., odds "
"ratios), negative effects are log ratios below zero (ratios below one)."
msgstr ""
"処置の有益さを示す処置効果の向きです。処置の順位づけ(P スコア、SUCRA、最良で"
"ある確率、平均順位と順位の中央値、ランコグラム)と、リーグ表と"
"フォレストプロットの順位づけによる並び順を決めます。比の指標(オッズ比など)で"
"は、負の効果とは0未満の対数比(1未満の比)のことです。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Negative"
msgstr "負"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Treatment effects below zero are beneficial (e.g., fewer adverse events or "
"lower symptom scores)."
msgstr "0未満の処置効果が有益です(有害事象が少ない、症状の得点が低いなど)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Positive"
msgstr "正"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Treatment effects above zero are beneficial (e.g., more recoveries or higher "
"quality of life)."
msgstr "0より大きい処置効果が有益です(回復が多い、生活の質が高いなど)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr "モデル"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Model of the treatment effects. The standard model estimates a separate "
"effect for each treatment. The component model (additive component network "
"meta-analysis) estimates the effects of the components that form the "
"treatments (e.g., the parts of combination therapies) and models each "
"treatment effect as the sum of the effects of its components."
msgstr ""
"処置効果のモデルです。標準モデルは処置ごとに別々の効果を推定します。成分"
"モデル(加法的な成分ネットワークメタ分析)は、処置を構成する成分(併用療法の各部"
"分など)の効果を推定し、各処置効果をその成分の効果の和としてモデル化します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "標準"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Standard network meta-analysis: a separate effect for each treatment. The Q "
"statistics of the network meta-analytic tests (total, within designs, and "
"between designs) are based on the common-effect model, also for random-"
"effects analyses; the design-by-treatment interaction model is a random-"
"effects model."
msgstr ""
"標準のネットワークメタ分析です。処置ごとに別々の効果を推定します。"
"ネットワークメタ分析の検定(全体、デザイン内、デザイン間)の Q 統計量は、変量効"
"果の分析でも共通効果モデルにもとづきます。デザインと処置の交互作用モデルは変"
"量効果モデルです。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Slopes"
msgstr "傾き"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Assumption about the effect of the predictor on the treatment effects "
"(versus the reference treatment) in the network meta-regression, available "
"when a predictor is included. 'Independent' estimates a separate slope for "
"each treatment, 'Common' a single slope shared by all treatments. The slopes "
"are not transformed; their standard errors are shown under an effect size "
"transformation only if 'Standard errors' is checked."
msgstr ""
"ネットワークメタ回帰で、予測変数が(基準の処置に対する)処置効果に及ぼす効果に"
"ついての仮定です。予測変数を含めた場合に使えます。「独立」 は処置ごとに別々の"
"傾きを、「共通」 はすべての処置で共有する1つの傾きを推定します。傾きは変換さ"
"れません。効果量の変換のもとで傾きの標準誤差が表示されるのは、「標準誤差」 に"
"チェックを入れた場合だけです。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Independent"
msgstr "独立"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Separate slope for each treatment versus the reference treatment."
msgstr "基準の処置に対して、処置ごとに別々の傾きを推定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Common"
msgstr "共通"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Common slope for all treatments versus the reference treatment."
msgstr "基準の処置に対して、すべての処置で共通の傾きを推定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Component"
msgstr "成分"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Additive component network meta-analysis: each treatment effect is the sum "
"of the effects of its components (plus the checked interactions). The Q "
"statistics of the additive (component) model and the standard model are "
"based on the common-effect model; their difference tests whether the "
"standard model, which does not restrict the treatment effects to the sums of "
"the effects of their components, fits better than the additive model. The "
"component model can also analyze disconnected networks whose subnetworks "
"share components. It uses a moment estimator of the between-study variance "
"and normal-theory inference; the inconsistency, small-study effects, and "
"evidence structure analyses, the network meta-regression, the rank "
"probabilities, and the prediction intervals are not available. Not available "
"for the Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and penalized logistic "
"regression pooling methods (selecting one of them switches the model to "
"Standard)."
msgstr ""
"加法的な成分ネットワークメタ分析です。各処置効果は、その成分の効果の和(と"
"チェックした交互作用)です。加法(成分)モデルと標準モデルの Q 統計量は共通効果"
"モデルにもとづきます。両者の差は、処置効果をその成分の効果の和に制限しない標"
"準モデルが、加法モデルよりよく当てはまるかを検定します。成分モデルは、部分"
"ネットワークが成分を共有する連結していないネットワークも分析できます。研究間"
"分散にはモーメント推定量を、推論には正規理論を使います。非一貫性、小規模研究"
"効果、エビデンスの構造の分析、ネットワークメタ回帰、順位の確率、予測区間は使"
"えません。Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布による方法、罰則付き"
"ロジスティック回帰の統合方法では使えません(これらのいずれかを選ぶと、モデル"
"は 「標準」 に切り替わります)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Components"
msgstr "コンポーネント"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Specify how the components of the treatments are defined."
msgstr "処置の成分をどのように定義するかを指定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Split names"
msgstr "名前を分割"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The components are the parts of the treatment names split at the separator "
"(e.g., 'A+B' consists of the components 'A' and 'B')."
msgstr ""
"成分は、処置の名前を区切り文字で分割した各部分です('A+B' は成分 'A' と 'B' か"
"らなります)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Indicators"
msgstr "指示変数"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The components are defined by the 0/1 indicator variables assigned in "
"'Component Indicators'. The treatment with all indicators equal to zero is "
"the inactive treatment."
msgstr ""
"成分は、「成分の指示変数」 に割り当てた 0/1 の指示変数で定義します。すべての"
"指示変数が0の処置が不活性の処置です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Character separating the components in the treatment names (a single "
"character)."
msgstr "処置の名前の中で成分を区切る文字です(1文字)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Inactive treatment"
msgstr "不活性の処置"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Treatment without active components (e.g., placebo), available if the "
"components are defined by splitting the treatment names. Its effect is fixed "
"to zero and it is not treated as a component. The list shows the treatments "
"whose names do not contain the separator."
msgstr ""
"活性のある成分をもたない処置(プラセボなど)です。成分を処置の名前の分割で定義"
"する場合に使えます。その効果は0に固定され、成分としては扱われません。一覧には"
"、名前に区切り文字を含まない処置が表示されます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Interactions"
msgstr "交互作用"

msgctxt "ClassicalNetworkMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Treatment combinations whose effect may differ from the sum of the effects "
"of their components (synergy or antagonism): an interaction between the "
"components of each checked combination is added to the additive model. The "
"list shows the treatments whose names contain the separator. With "
"indicators, an interaction is specified by an additional indicator variable "
"(1 for the treatments that contain all of its components)."
msgstr ""
"効果がその成分の効果の和と異なりうる処置の組み合わせ(相乗作用や拮抗作用)です"
"。チェックした組み合わせごとに、その成分間の交互作用を加法モデルに加えます。"
"一覧には、名前に区切り文字を含む処置が表示されます。指示変数を使う場合は、交"
"互作用を追加の指示変数(そのすべての成分を含む処置で1)で指定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid ""
"Select the model for the between-study heterogeneity. 'Equal Effects' fits "
"the common-effect network meta-analysis; the other methods fit the random-"
"effects network meta-analysis with a common between-study variance estimated "
"by the selected estimator. The restricted ML and maximum likelihood "
"estimates of the between-study variance can depend on the choice of the "
"reference treatment for contrast-based data with multi-arm studies. The "
"component model estimates the between-study variance by the method of "
"moments (DerSimonian-Laird). For penalized logistic regression, 'Random "
"Effects (dispersion)' models the heterogeneity by a dispersion factor (no "
"estimator is used), and for the Mantel-Haenszel and non-central "
"hypergeometric methods only 'Equal Effects' is available."
msgstr ""
"研究間の異質性のモデルを選びます。「等効果」 は共通効果のネットワークメタ分析"
"を当てはめ、ほかの方法は、選んだ推定量で推定した共通の研究間分散をもつ変量効"
"果のネットワークメタ分析を当てはめます。研究間分散の制限付き最尤推定値と最尤"
"推定値は、多群の研究を含む対比ベースのデータでは、基準の処置の選び方に依存す"
"ることがあります。成分モデルは研究間分散をモーメント法(DerSimonian-Laird)で推"
"定します。罰則付きロジスティック回帰では 「変量効果 (過分散)」 が異質性を過分"
"散の係数でモデル化し(推定量は使いません)、Mantel-Haenszel 法と非心超幾何分布"
"による方法では 「等効果」 だけが使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMethod|"
msgid "Random Effects (dispersion)"
msgstr "変量効果 (過分散)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include I², the percentage of total variation across studies due to "
"heterogeneity within designs and inconsistency between designs (it is based "
"on the total Q statistic of the network, or, for the component model, on the "
"Q statistic of the additive model), with its confidence interval."
msgstr ""
"研究間の全変動のうち、デザイン内の異質性とデザイン間の非一貫性によるものの割"
"合であるI²を、その信頼区間とともに含めます(ネットワークの全体の Q 統計量、成"
"分モデルでは加法モデルの Q 統計量にもとづきます)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Summarize the estimated relative treatment effects of the network."
msgstr "ネットワークで推定された相対的な処置効果をまとめます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Treatment effects"
msgstr "処置効果"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Include a table with the estimated relative treatment effects."
msgstr "推定された相対的な処置効果の表を含めます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Select the comparisons shown in the treatment effects table."
msgstr "処置効果の表に示す比較を選びます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Versus reference"
msgstr "基準との比較"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Show the effect of each treatment versus the reference treatment."
msgstr "基準の処置に対する各処置の効果を示します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "All pairwise comparisons"
msgstr "すべての対比較"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Show the effects of all pairs of treatments."
msgstr "すべての処置の対の効果を示します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "League table"
msgstr "リーグ表"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include a league table with the network estimates (lower triangle, column "
"versus row treatment) and the direct estimates (upper triangle, row versus "
"column treatment)."
msgstr ""
"ネットワーク推定値(下三角、列の処置 対 行の処置)と直接推定値(上三角、行の処"
"置 対 列の処置)を示すリーグ表を含めます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "順序"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Order of the treatments in the league table."
msgstr "リーグ表での処置の並び順です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Treatment order"
msgstr "処置の順序"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Order of the treatments in the network."
msgstr "ネットワークでの処置の順序です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Ranking (P-score)"
msgstr "順位づけ (P スコア)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Order by the P-score ranking of the treatments (the best treatment first, "
"according to the 'Beneficial effect' setting below the data format)."
msgstr ""
"処置の P スコアによる順位づけで並べます(データの形式の下にある 「有益な効果"
"」 の設定に従い、最良の処置が先頭)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Direct estimates in upper triangle"
msgstr "上三角に直接推定値"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Show the direct (pairwise) estimates in the upper triangle. Otherwise, the "
"upper triangle shows the network estimates. Not available for the component "
"model, which shows its estimates in both triangles."
msgstr ""
"上三角に直接(対比較の)推定値を示します。オフにすると、上三角にはネットワーク"
"推定値が表示されます。成分モデルでは使えません(成分モデルは両方の三角に推定値"
"を示します)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Show confidence intervals next to the estimates in the league table."
msgstr "リーグ表の推定値の横に信頼区間を示します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Component effects"
msgstr "成分の効果"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with the estimated effects of the components (relative to "
"the inactive treatment if one is specified). Available for the component "
"model."
msgstr ""
"推定された成分の効果の表を含めます(不活性の処置を指定した場合は、それに対する"
"効果です)。成分モデルで使えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include standard errors in the tabular output. Only available when no effect "
"size transformation is applied (the standard errors of the network meta-"
"regression slopes, which are not transformed, are shown under a "
"transformation only if this option is checked)."
msgstr ""
"表の出力に標準誤差を含めます。効果量の変換を適用していない場合にのみ使えます"
"(ネットワークメタ回帰の傾きは変換されないため、その標準誤差は、このオプション"
"にチェックを入れた場合に限り、変換のもとでも表示されます)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include prediction intervals in the tabular output, based on the t-"
"distribution with the degrees of freedom of the overall Q statistic. Only "
"available for random-effects models of the standard model (not for the "
"component model and the Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and "
"penalized logistic regression pooling methods)."
msgstr ""
"表の出力に予測区間を含めます。予測区間は、全体の Q 統計量の自由度をもつ t 分"
"布にもとづきます。標準モデルの変量効果モデルでのみ使えます(成分モデルと、"
"Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布法、罰則付きロジスティック回帰の統合方法で"
"は使えません)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Select a transformation to apply to the treatment effect estimates in the "
"output. This transformation applies to the estimates and intervals of the "
"treatment effects, league table, direct and indirect evidence, network meta-"
"regression, component effects, the forest plots, and the axis of the funnel "
"plot. The heterogeneity statistics, the rankings, the tests, and the slopes "
"of the network meta-regression are not transformed. The exponential "
"transformation turns the differences between the direct and indirect "
"estimates into ratios."
msgstr ""
"出力の処置効果の推定値に適用する変換を選びます。この変換は、処置効果、リーグ"
"表、直接エビデンスと間接エビデンス、ネットワークメタ回帰、成分の効果の推定値"
"と区間、フォレストプロット、ファンネルプロットの軸に適用されます。異質性の統"
"計量、順位づけ、検定、ネットワークメタ回帰の傾きは変換されません。指数変換で"
"は、直接推定値と間接推定値の差が比になります。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "詳細"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Advanced options for the network meta-analysis."
msgstr "ネットワークメタ分析の詳細オプションです。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Show netmeta R code"
msgstr "netmetaのRコードを表示"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Display the R code that fits the model(s) of the analysis with the meta and "
"netmeta packages (the code reproduces the fitted models, not the tables and "
"plots of the selected outputs)."
msgstr ""
"分析のモデルを meta パッケージと netmeta パッケージで当てはめる R コードを表"
"示します(このコードで再現されるのは当てはめたモデルであり、選んだ出力の表や図"
"は再現されません)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Include full dataset in subgroup analysis"
msgstr "サブグループ分析に全データを含める"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Include the full dataset output in the subgroup analysis. This option is "
"only available when the subgroup analysis is selected."
msgstr ""
"サブグループ分析の出力に全データの結果を含めます。このオプションは"
"サブグループ分析を選んだ場合にのみ使えます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Multi-arm consistency tolerance"
msgstr "多群の研究の一貫性の許容誤差"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Tolerance for the consistency check of the treatment effects of multi-arm "
"studies specified by all of their pairwise comparisons (contrast-based "
"data); only the consistency of the effect sizes is checked."
msgstr ""
"多群の研究について、すべての対比較で指定した処置効果(対比ベースのデータ)の一"
"貫性を確かめるときの許容誤差です。確かめるのは効果量の一貫性だけです。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "League table decimal places"
msgstr "リーグ表の小数点以下の桁数"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Number of decimal places shown for estimates and confidence limits in the "
"league table."
msgstr "リーグ表に示す推定値と信頼限界の小数点以下の桁数です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Number of ranking simulations"
msgstr "順位づけのシミュレーション回数"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Number of simulations used to resample the treatment effects for the SUCRA, "
"probability of being best, mean and median rank, and the rankogram "
"(reproducible with the 'Set seed' option)."
msgstr ""
"SUCRA、最良である確率、平均順位と順位の中央値、ランコグラムのために処置効果を"
"再標本抽出するシミュレーションの回数です(「シードを設定」のオプションで再現で"
"きます)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Fix Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータを固定する"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Fix model parameters instead of estimating them. Only available for random-"
"effects models."
msgstr "モデルのパラメータを推定せずに固定します。変量効果モデルでのみ利用できます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "𝜏²"
msgstr "𝜏²"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Fix the value of 𝜏² (the common between-study variance) instead of "
"estimating it. Only available for random-effects models."
msgstr ""
"𝜏²(共通の研究間分散)の値を推定せずに固定します。変量効果モデルでのみ利用でき"
"ます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Value of 𝜏² (the common between-study variance) used in the model."
msgstr "モデルで使う𝜏²(共通の研究間分散)の値です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Continuity Correction"
msgstr "連続性の補正"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Options for handling zero frequencies in arm-based binary and incidence rate "
"data. The continuity correction is applied to the pairwise effect sizes "
"computed from the arm-level data, which the inverse variance analysis pools. "
"The Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and penalized logistic "
"regression estimates are computed from the event counts without a continuity "
"correction."
msgstr ""
"群ベースの2値データと発生率データで、度数が0の場合の扱いを指定するオプション"
"です。連続性の補正は、群ベースのデータから計算した対比較の効果量に適用され、"
"分散の逆数法による分析ではそれらを統合します。Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何"
"分布法、罰則付きロジスティック回帰の推定値は、連続性の補正をせずにイベント数"
"から計算します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "加える値"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Value added to the frequencies for the continuity correction."
msgstr "連続性の補正のために度数に加える値です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "To"
msgstr "加える対象"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Select to which studies the continuity correction is applied."
msgstr "連続性の補正をどの研究に適用するかを選びます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "All"
msgstr "すべて"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Add the value to all studies."
msgstr "すべての研究に値を加えます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Only zero"
msgstr "0のセルのみ"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Add the value to studies with a zero frequency."
msgstr "度数が0の研究に値を加えます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "If any zero"
msgstr "0のセルがある場合"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Add the value to all studies if any study has a zero frequency."
msgstr "いずれかの研究で度数が0のとき、すべての研究に値を加えます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Do not apply a continuity correction."
msgstr "連続性の補正を適用しません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Drop studies with no cases/events"
msgstr "ケース・イベントがない研究を除く"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Specify whether studies with zero events (or non-events) in all arms are "
"dropped from the analysis. This applies to the inverse variance analysis of "
"the odds ratio and the risk ratio (the other measures keep these studies). "
"The group is disabled for the Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, "
"and penalized logistic regression methods, which do not use it: the Mantel-"
"Haenszel and non-central hypergeometric methods always exclude the studies "
"without events (and the designs with zero cells), and penalized logistic "
"regression keeps all studies."
msgstr ""
"すべての群でイベント(または非イベント)が0の研究を分析から除くかどうかを指定し"
"ます。これはオッズ比とリスク比の分散の逆数法による分析に適用されます(ほかの指"
"標ではこれらの研究を残します)。Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布法、罰則付き"
"ロジスティック回帰はこの設定を使わないため、これらの方法ではこのグループは無"
"効になります。Mantel-Haenszel 法と非心超幾何分布法では、イベントのない研究(お"
"よび0のセルがあるデザイン)を常に除き、罰則付きロジスティック回帰ではすべての"
"研究を残します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "はい"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Drop studies without cases/events in all arms."
msgstr "すべての群でケース・イベントがない研究を除きます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "No"
msgstr "いいえ"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Keep studies without cases/events in all arms."
msgstr "すべての群でケース・イベントがない研究を残します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid "Evidence Structure"
msgstr "エビデンスの構造"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid ""
"Options for describing how the evidence of the network contributes to the "
"network estimates. Available for the standard model."
msgstr ""
"ネットワークのエビデンスがネットワーク推定値にどのように寄与しているかを記述"
"するオプションです。標準モデルで利用できます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid "Direct evidence proportion"
msgstr "直接エビデンスの割合"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with the proportion of direct evidence contributing to each "
"network estimate, the mean path length, and the minimal parallelism (the "
"last two describe the indirect evidence; König et al., 2013). The mean path "
"length and the minimal parallelism are not available for the Mantel-"
"Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and penalized logistic regression "
"pooling methods. The minimal parallelism is not defined for a network of two "
"treatments."
msgstr ""
"各ネットワーク推定値に寄与する直接エビデンスの割合、平均経路長、最小並列性の"
"表を含めます(後の2つは間接エビデンスを記述するものです。König et al., 2013)。"
"平均経路長と最小並列性は、統合の方法が Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布法、"
"罰則付きロジスティック回帰のときは利用できません。処置が2つのネットワークでは"
"、最小並列性は定義されません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid "Contribution matrix"
msgstr "寄与行列"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid ""
"Include a matrix with the contribution of each direct comparison to each "
"network estimate. Not available for the Mantel-Haenszel, non-central "
"hypergeometric, and penalized logistic regression pooling methods."
msgstr ""
"各直接比較が各ネットワーク推定値に寄与する度合いの行列を含めます。統合の方法"
"が Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布法、罰則付きロジスティック回帰のときは利"
"用できません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid "Method used to compute the contributions of the direct comparisons."
msgstr "直接比較の寄与を計算する方法です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid "Shortest path"
msgstr "最短経路"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid ""
"Iterative algorithm that decomposes the flow of evidence in the network into "
"streams, each of them following a shortest path (Papakonstantinou et al., "
"2018)."
msgstr ""
"ネットワーク内のエビデンスの流れを、それぞれが最短経路をたどる流れに分解する"
"反復アルゴリズムです(Papakonstantinou et al., 2018)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid "Random walk"
msgstr "ランダムウォーク"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid ""
"Analytical random walk approach that decomposes the flow of evidence in the "
"network (Davies et al., 2022)."
msgstr ""
"ネットワーク内のエビデンスの流れを分解する、解析的なランダムウォークの方法で"
"す(Davies et al., 2022)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid "Pseudoinverse"
msgstr "擬似逆行列"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid ""
"Contributions derived from an L2 solution based on a Moore-Penrose "
"pseudoinverse (Rücker et al., 2024)."
msgstr ""
"Moore-Penrose の擬似逆行列にもとづく L2 解から求めた寄与です(Rücker et al., "
"2024)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid "Study impact"
msgstr "研究の影響"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid ""
"Include a matrix with the impact of each study on each network estimate, the "
"reduction in precision of the network estimate if the study is removed. The "
"columns follow the comparisons of the treatment effects table (versus the "
"reference treatment, or all pairwise comparisons if selected there). The "
"computation refits the network once per study and is slow: it can take "
"several minutes, in particular for the Mantel-Haenszel and non-central "
"hypergeometric pooling methods."
msgstr ""
"各研究が各ネットワーク推定値に与える影響、すなわちその研究を除いたときの"
"ネットワーク推定値の精度の低下を表す行列を含めます。列は処置効果の表の比較に"
"従います(基準の処置との比較、またはそこで選んだ場合はすべての対比較)。計算で"
"は研究ごとにネットワークを当てはめ直すため時間がかかり、特に統合の方法が "
"Mantel-Haenszel 法と非心超幾何分布法のときは数分かかることがあります。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid "Pairwise meta-analyses"
msgstr "対比較のメタ分析"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisEvidence|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with the separate pairwise meta-analyses of the directly "
"compared treatments (the studies that directly compare the two treatments, "
"separately for each comparison). The between-study variance of each "
"comparison is estimated by the method selected for the network meta-"
"analysis; a comparison with a single study has no between-study variance."
msgstr ""
"直接比較された処置について、個別の対比較のメタ分析の表を含めます(比較ごとに、"
"その2つの処置を直接比較した研究を使います)。各比較の研究間分散は、"
"ネットワークメタ分析で選んだ方法で推定します。研究が1つしかない比較には研究間"
"分散がありません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Forest Plot"
msgstr "フォレストプロット"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Options for visualizing the network estimates in a forest plot. The settings "
"below apply to all forest plots of the analysis."
msgstr ""
"ネットワーク推定値をフォレストプロットで可視化するオプションです。以下の設定"
"は、この分析のすべてのフォレストプロットに適用されます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Forest plot"
msgstr "フォレストプロット"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Include a forest plot of the network treatment effects."
msgstr "ネットワークの処置効果のフォレストプロットを含めます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Select the comparisons shown in the forest plot."
msgstr "フォレストプロットに示す比較を選びます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Versus reference"
msgstr "基準との比較"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Show the effect of each treatment versus the reference treatment."
msgstr "各処置の基準の処置に対する効果を表示します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "All pairwise comparisons"
msgstr "すべての対比較"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Show the effects of all pairs of treatments, grouped by treatment (each "
"treatment versus all other treatments)."
msgstr ""
"処置のすべての対の効果を、処置ごとにまとめて表示します(各処置とほかのすべての"
"処置との比較)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "順序"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Order of the treatments in the forest plot."
msgstr "フォレストプロットにおける処置の順序です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Treatment order"
msgstr "処置の順序"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Order of the treatments in the network."
msgstr "ネットワークにおける処置の順序です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Effect size"
msgstr "効果量"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Order by the estimated effect size."
msgstr "推定された効果量の順に並べます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Ranking (P-score)"
msgstr "順位づけ(P スコア)"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Order by the P-score ranking of the treatments (the best treatment first, "
"according to the 'Beneficial effect' setting below the data format)."
msgstr ""
"処置の P スコアによる順位づけの順に並べます(データの形式の下にある「有益な効"
"果」の設定に従い、最良の処置が先頭になります)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Component forest plot"
msgstr "成分のフォレストプロット"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Include a forest plot of the component effects. Available for the component "
"model."
msgstr "成分の効果のフォレストプロットを含めます。成分モデルで利用できます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Include the prediction intervals of the network treatment effects in the "
"forest plots (random-effects model of the inverse variance pooling)."
msgstr ""
"フォレストプロットに、ネットワークの処置効果の予測区間を含めます(分散の逆数法"
"で統合した変量効果モデル)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Inconsistency"
msgstr "非一貫性"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid ""
"Options for assessing the inconsistency between direct and indirect evidence "
"in the network. Available for the standard model."
msgstr ""
"ネットワークにおける直接エビデンスと間接エビデンスの間の非一貫性を評価する"
"オプションです。標準モデルで利用できます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Design decomposition"
msgstr "デザインによる分解"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid ""
"Include the decomposition of the Cochran's Q statistic (common-effect model) "
"into the within-design heterogeneity (per design) and the between-design "
"inconsistency after detaching single designs. The test of the full design-by-"
"treatment interaction model of the random-effects model is shown in the "
"table of the network meta-analytic tests. Not available for the Mantel-"
"Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and penalized logistic regression "
"pooling methods."
msgstr ""
"Cochran の Q 統計量(共通効果モデル)を、デザイン内の異質性(デザインごと)と、"
"デザインを1つずつ外したときのデザイン間の非一貫性に分解した結果を含めます。変"
"量効果モデルにおけるデザインと処置の交互作用の完全モデルの検定は、"
"ネットワークメタ分析の検定の表に示します。統合の方法が Mantel-Haenszel 法、非"
"心超幾何分布法、罰則付きロジスティック回帰のときは利用できません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Net heat plot"
msgstr "ネットヒートプロット"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid ""
"Include a net heat plot visualizing the inconsistency between designs and "
"its drivers. Available for networks with more than two designs and degrees "
"of freedom for the between-design inconsistency. Not available for the "
"Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and penalized logistic "
"regression pooling methods."
msgstr ""
"デザイン間の非一貫性とその要因を可視化するネットヒートプロットを含めます。"
"デザインが3つ以上あり、デザイン間の非一貫性に自由度があるネットワークで利用で"
"きます。統合の方法が Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布法、罰則付き"
"ロジスティック回帰のときは利用できません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Direct and indirect evidence"
msgstr "直接エビデンスと間接エビデンス"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid ""
"Include a table comparing the direct and indirect evidence for each "
"treatment comparison (node-splitting) with a z-test of the disagreement "
"between the direct and the indirect evidence. The difference is the direct "
"minus the indirect estimate (under the exponential transformation, the ratio "
"of the direct to the indirect estimate). For the Mantel-Haenszel and non-"
"central hypergeometric pooling methods only SIDDE is available, which is "
"slow (the computation takes several minutes); not available for penalized "
"logistic regression. The test of the difference uses normal-theory (z) "
"inference."
msgstr ""
"処置の比較ごとに直接エビデンスと間接エビデンスを比べた表(ノード分割)を、直接"
"エビデンスと間接エビデンスの食い違いの z 検定とともに含めます。差は直接推定値"
"から間接推定値を引いたものです(指数変換のもとでは、直接推定値の間接推定値に対"
"する比)。統合の方法が Mantel-Haenszel 法と非心超幾何分布法のときは SIDDE だけ"
"が利用でき、時間がかかります(計算に数分かかります)。罰則付きロジスティック回"
"帰では利用できません。差の検定には正規理論(z)にもとづく推測を用います。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid ""
"Method used to split the direct and indirect evidence. Not available for the "
"Mantel-Haenszel and non-central hypergeometric pooling methods, which always "
"use SIDDE (slow: several minutes)."
msgstr ""
"直接エビデンスと間接エビデンスを分割する方法です。統合の方法が Mantel-"
"Haenszel 法と非心超幾何分布法のときは利用できず、常に SIDDE を使います(時間が"
"かかります。数分)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Back-calculation"
msgstr "逆算法"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid ""
"Back-calculation method: the indirect evidence is derived from the network "
"and direct estimates."
msgstr "逆算法です。間接エビデンスを、ネットワーク推定値と直接推定値から導きます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "SIDDE"
msgstr "SIDDE"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid ""
"Separate indirect from direct design evidence (SIDDE). Slow: the computation "
"can take several minutes."
msgstr ""
"直接のデザインのエビデンスから間接エビデンスを分離します(SIDDE)。時間がかかり"
"ます。計算に数分かかることがあります。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Show"
msgstr "表示"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Select the comparisons included in the table."
msgstr "表に含める比較を選びます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "All comparisons"
msgstr "すべての比較"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Show all comparisons."
msgstr "すべての比較を表示します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "With direct and indirect evidence"
msgstr "直接エビデンスと間接エビデンスがある比較"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Show only comparisons with both direct and indirect evidence."
msgstr "直接エビデンスと間接エビデンスの両方がある比較だけを表示します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "With direct evidence"
msgstr "直接エビデンスがある比較"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Show only comparisons with direct evidence."
msgstr "直接エビデンスがある比較だけを表示します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid "Forest plot"
msgstr "フォレストプロット"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisInconsistency|"
msgid ""
"Visualize the direct, indirect, and network estimates of each comparison in "
"a forest plot."
msgstr ""
"各比較の直接推定値、間接推定値、ネットワーク推定値をフォレストプロットで可視"
"化します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Network Plot"
msgstr "ネットワーク図"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Options for visualizing the structure of the treatment network."
msgstr "処置のネットワークの構造を可視化するオプションです。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Network plot"
msgstr "ネットワーク図"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid ""
"Include a plot of the treatment network. Treatments are shown as nodes, and "
"the direct comparisons as edges."
msgstr ""
"処置のネットワークの図を含めます。処置をノード、直接比較をエッジとして示しま"
"す。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "レイアウト"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid ""
"Arrangement of the treatments in the network plot. The network plot of the "
"component model of a disconnected network and the network plot of a network "
"of two treatments always use the circle layout."
msgstr ""
"ネットワーク図における処置の配置です。連結していないネットワークの成分モデル"
"のネットワーク図と、処置が2つのネットワークのネットワーク図では、常に円形の配"
"置を使います。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Circle"
msgstr "円"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Treatments arranged on a circle in the order of the network."
msgstr "処置をネットワークの順序で円周上に配置します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Circle (minimal crossings)"
msgstr "円(交差を最小化)"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid ""
"Treatments arranged on a circle in an order that reduces the crossing of the "
"edges."
msgstr "エッジの交差が少なくなる順序で、処置を円周上に配置します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Stress majorization"
msgstr "ストレス・マジョライゼーション"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid ""
"Layout in which the distances between the treatments reflect the network "
"structure."
msgstr "処置間の距離がネットワークの構造を反映する配置です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Edge width"
msgstr "エッジの幅"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Quantity determining the width of the edges."
msgstr "エッジの幅を決める量です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Number of studies"
msgstr "研究の数"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Edges are wider for comparisons with more studies."
msgstr "研究の数が多い比較ほどエッジを太くします。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "精度"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid ""
"Edges are wider for more precise direct estimates (inverse standard error). "
"The component model of a disconnected network has no direct estimates: the "
"edge widths show the number of studies then."
msgstr ""
"直接推定値の精度が高い(標準誤差の逆数が大きい)ほどエッジを太くします。連結し"
"ていないネットワークの成分モデルには直接推定値がないため、その場合のエッジの"
"幅は研究の数を示します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Equal"
msgstr "均等"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "All edges have the same width."
msgstr "すべてのエッジを同じ幅にします。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Node size"
msgstr "ノードサイズ"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid ""
"Quantity determining the size of the nodes. The sample size is available for "
"arm-based binary and continuous data."
msgstr ""
"ノードの大きさを決める量です。サンプルサイズは、群ベースの2値データと連続"
"データで利用できます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "All nodes have the same size."
msgstr "すべてのノードを同じ大きさにします。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Nodes are larger for treatments evaluated in more studies."
msgstr "より多くの研究で評価された処置ほどノードを大きくします。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Sample size"
msgstr "サンプルサイズ"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Nodes are larger for treatments with more participants."
msgstr "参加者が多い処置ほどノードを大きくします。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Number of studies on edges"
msgstr "エッジ上の研究の数"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Show the number of studies of each comparison on the edges."
msgstr "各比較の研究の数をエッジ上に表示します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Highlight multi-arm studies"
msgstr "多群の研究を強調"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Highlight the treatments of multi-arm studies by colored areas."
msgstr "多群の研究の処置を色つきの領域で強調します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大きさ"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid ""
"Adjust the size of the network plot elements (relative to the default size)."
msgstr "ネットワーク図の要素の大きさを調整します(既定の大きさに対する相対値)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Nodes"
msgstr "ノード"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Relative size of the nodes (treatments)."
msgstr "ノード(処置)の相対的な大きさです。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Edges"
msgstr "エッジ"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Relative width of the edges (direct comparisons)."
msgstr "エッジ(直接比較)の相対的な幅です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Text"
msgstr "文字"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisNetworkPlot|"
msgid "Relative size of the treatment labels and the numbers of studies."
msgstr "処置のラベルと研究の数の相対的な大きさです。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid "Ranking"
msgstr "順位づけ"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid ""
"Options for ranking the treatments of the network. The direction of "
"beneficial treatment effects is set by 'Beneficial effect' below the data "
"format."
msgstr ""
"ネットワークの処置を順位づけするオプションです。処置効果が有益となる向きは、"
"データの形式の下にある「有益な効果」で設定します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid "Treatment ranking"
msgstr "処置の順位づけ"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid "Include a table ranking the treatments."
msgstr "処置を順位づけした表を含めます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid "P-score"
msgstr "P スコア"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid ""
"Include the P-score of each treatment, the mean extent of certainty that the "
"treatment is better than the other treatments (analytic, no simulation)."
msgstr ""
"各処置の P スコア、すなわちその処置がほかの処置より優れていることの確からしさ"
"の平均を含めます(解析的に求め、シミュレーションは使いません)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid "SUCRA"
msgstr "SUCRA"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid ""
"Include the surface under the cumulative ranking curve (SUCRA) of each "
"treatment. Computed from resampled treatment effects (the number of "
"simulations is set in the 'Advanced' section). Not available for the "
"component model, a network of two treatments, and the Mantel-Haenszel, non-"
"central hypergeometric, and penalized logistic regression pooling methods."
msgstr ""
"各処置の累積順位曲線の下の面積(SUCRA)を含めます。再標本抽出した処置効果から計"
"算します(シミュレーションの回数は「詳細」のセクションで設定します)。成分"
"モデル、処置が2つのネットワーク、統合の方法が Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何"
"分布法、罰則付きロジスティック回帰のときは利用できません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid "Probability of being best"
msgstr "最良である確率"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid ""
"Include the probability that each treatment is the best treatment. Computed "
"from resampled treatment effects (the number of simulations is set in the "
"'Advanced' section). Not available for the component model, a network of two "
"treatments, and the Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and "
"penalized logistic regression pooling methods."
msgstr ""
"各処置が最良の処置である確率を含めます。再標本抽出した処置効果から計算します"
"(シミュレーションの回数は「詳細」のセクションで設定します)。成分モデル、処置"
"が2つのネットワーク、統合の方法が Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布法、罰則"
"付きロジスティック回帰のときは利用できません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid "Mean rank"
msgstr "平均順位"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid ""
"Include the mean rank of each treatment. Computed from resampled treatment "
"effects (the number of simulations is set in the 'Advanced' section). Not "
"available for the component model, a network of two treatments, and the "
"Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and penalized logistic "
"regression pooling methods."
msgstr ""
"各処置の平均順位を含めます。再標本抽出した処置効果から計算します"
"(シミュレーションの回数は「詳細」のセクションで設定します)。成分モデル、処置"
"が2つのネットワーク、統合の方法が Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布法、罰則"
"付きロジスティック回帰のときは利用できません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid "Median rank"
msgstr "順位の中央値"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid ""
"Include the median rank of each treatment. Computed from resampled treatment "
"effects (the number of simulations is set in the 'Advanced' section). Not "
"available for the component model, a network of two treatments, and the "
"Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and penalized logistic "
"regression pooling methods."
msgstr ""
"各処置の順位の中央値を含めます。再標本抽出した処置効果から計算します"
"(シミュレーションの回数は「詳細」のセクションで設定します)。成分モデル、処置"
"が2つのネットワーク、統合の方法が Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布法、罰則"
"付きロジスティック回帰のときは利用できません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid "Rankogram"
msgstr "ランコグラム"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid ""
"Visualize the probabilities of each treatment taking each rank, computed "
"from resampled treatment effects (the number of simulations is set in the "
"'Advanced' section). Not available for the component model, a network of two "
"treatments, and the Mantel-Haenszel, non-central hypergeometric, and "
"penalized logistic regression pooling methods."
msgstr ""
"各処置が各順位をとる確率を可視化します。確率は再標本抽出した処置効果から計算"
"します(シミュレーションの回数は「詳細」のセクションで設定します)。成分モデル"
"、処置が2つのネットワーク、統合の方法が Mantel-Haenszel 法、非心超幾何分布法"
"、罰則付きロジスティック回帰のときは利用できません。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid "Cumulative"
msgstr "累積"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisRanking|"
msgid ""
"Show the cumulative rank probabilities instead of the rank probabilities."
msgstr "順位の確率の代わりに、順位の累積確率を表示します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Small-Study Effects"
msgstr "小規模研究効果"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"Options for assessing small-study effects (e.g., publication bias) in the "
"network. Available for the standard model."
msgstr ""
"ネットワークにおける小規模研究効果(出版バイアスなど)を評価するオプションです"
"。標準モデルで利用できます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Comparison-adjusted funnel plot"
msgstr "比較で調整したファンネルプロット"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"Include a comparison-adjusted funnel plot. The treatment effects of the "
"individual comparisons are centered at the pooled direct estimate of the "
"comparison and plotted against their standard errors; asymmetry around zero "
"suggests small-study effects."
msgstr ""
"比較で調整したファンネルプロットを含めます。個々の比較の処置効果を、その比較"
"の統合した直接推定値を中心にそろえ、標準誤差に対してプロットします。0のまわり"
"の非対称性は小規模研究効果を示唆します。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Pseudo confidence intervals"
msgstr "疑似信頼区間"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"Include the 90%, 95%, and 99% pseudo confidence regions around zero in the "
"funnel plot (shaded as in the Funnel Plot analysis)."
msgstr ""
"ファンネルプロットに、0のまわりの90%、95%、99%の疑似信頼領域を含めます"
"(ファンネルプロットの分析と同じように網かけします)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Asymmetry Tests"
msgstr "非対称性の検定"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"Tests of funnel plot asymmetry applied to the comparison-adjusted effects "
"(the study effects minus the pooled direct effect of their comparison). The "
"tests require at least 10 comparisons (study-level treatment effects)."
msgstr ""
"比較で調整した効果(研究の効果からその比較の統合した直接効果を引いたもの)に適"
"用する、ファンネルプロットの非対称性の検定です。検定には少なくとも10個の比較"
"(研究レベルの処置効果)が必要です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Egger"
msgstr "Egger"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Include the regression test of funnel plot asymmetry (Egger)."
msgstr "ファンネルプロットの非対称性の回帰検定(Egger)を含めます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Begg and Mazumdar"
msgstr "Begg と Mazumdar"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"Include the rank correlation test of funnel plot asymmetry (Begg and "
"Mazumdar)."
msgstr "ファンネルプロットの非対称性の順位相関検定(Begg と Mazumdar)を含めます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Thompson and Sharp"
msgstr "Thompson と Sharp"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"Include the regression test of funnel plot asymmetry (Thompson and Sharp)."
msgstr "ファンネルプロットの非対称性の回帰検定(Thompson と Sharp)を含めます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Treatment order"
msgstr "処置の順序"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"Order of the treatments used by the comparison-adjusted funnel plot and the "
"asymmetry tests: each comparison is oriented by the treatment that comes "
"first. Available when the funnel plot or an asymmetry test is included."
msgstr ""
"比較で調整したファンネルプロットと非対称性の検定で使う処置の順序です。各比較"
"の向きは、先に来る処置によって決まります。ファンネルプロットまたは非対称性の"
"検定を含めた場合に利用できます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"Order of the treatments determining the direction of each comparison in the "
"funnel plot and the asymmetry tests."
msgstr "ファンネルプロットと非対称性の検定で、各比較の向きを決める処置の順序です。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Reference treatment first"
msgstr "基準の処置を先頭に"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"The reference treatment comes first, followed by the other treatments in the "
"network order."
msgstr "基準の処置を先頭にし、そのあとにほかの処置をネットワークの順序で並べます。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "カスタム"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"Specify the order of the treatments by moving them to 'Treatment Order' "
"(shown below the options of the section)."
msgstr ""
"処置を「処置の順序」に移して、処置の順序を指定します(このセクションの"
"オプションの下に表示されます)。"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Treatments"
msgstr "処置"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid "Treatment Order"
msgstr "処置の順序"

msgctxt "NetworkMetaAnalysisSmallStudyEffects|"
msgid ""
"Order of the treatments for the funnel plot and the asymmetry tests: each "
"comparison is oriented by the treatment listed first (e.g., from the oldest "
"to the newest treatment, so that all comparisons are 'older versus newer'). "
"Treatments that are not listed follow in the order of the network."
msgstr ""
"ファンネルプロットと非対称性の検定で使う処置の順序です。各比較の向きは、先に"
"挙げた処置によって決まります(たとえば最も古い処置から最も新しい処置の順に並べ"
"ると、すべての比較が「古いもの対新しいもの」になります)。挙げていない処置は、"
"ネットワークの順序でそのあとに続きます。"
